"""Original bilingual curriculum units. Public engineering principles, not operating SOPs.
Numerical examples are original hypothetical teaching calculations, not vendor specifications.
"""
SPECS={}
def C(n, focus, focus_en, stages, stages_en, sources, related, group, example, example_en, limit, limit_en, units):
    parsed=[line.split('|') for line in units.strip().splitlines() if line.strip()]
    assert len(parsed)==12,(n,len(parsed))
    assert all(len(u)==6 for u in parsed),(n,[len(u) for u in parsed])
    SPECS[f'a{n}']=dict(focus=focus,focusEn=focus_en,stages=stages.split('|'),stagesEn=stages_en.split('|'),sourceKeys=sources.split(),related=related.split(),group=group,example=example,exampleEn=example_en,limit=limit,limitEn=limit_en,units=parsed)

C(236,'海上風能、發電機電磁設計與海洋環境的共同限制','coupled offshore wind, generator electromagnetics and marine conditions',
'能量與傳動|發電機與熱|電網與環境|整合與驗證','Energy and drivetrain|Generator and heat|Grid and environment|Integration and validation',
'wind15 wind5 windcollection','a237 a238','wind',
'教學例：15 MW、10 rpm 時，ω=2πn/60=1.047 rad/s，軸轉矩 T=P/ω=14.32 MN·m；若機電效率 96%，15 MW 軸輸入只得 14.4 MW 電輸出。這是量綱練習，不是參考風機額定規格。',
'Teaching example: at 15 MW and 10 rpm, ω=2πn/60=1.047 rad/s and shaft torque T=P/ω=14.32 MN·m. With 96% electromechanical efficiency, 15 MW shaft input yields 14.4 MW electrical output. This is a dimensional exercise, not a reference-turbine rating.',
'穩態功率平衡不描述疲勞、陣風、軸系扭振或短路；需分開做結構、熱與電網動態驗證。','Steady power balance does not describe fatigue, gusts, shaft torsion or faults; structural, thermal and grid-dynamic validation remain separate.',r'''
辨識能量邊界|Define energy boundaries|風流功率 ρAv³/2 不是可全數擷取的軸功率。|Flow power ρAv³/2 is not entirely extractable shaft power.|固定空氣密度，將風速 8 改為 10 m/s，比較理想可用功率比 1.953。|At fixed density compare available power at 8 and 10 m/s: the ratio is 1.953.
選擇直驅或齒輪傳動|Compare direct and geared drives|增速齒輪降低發電機轉矩需求，卻增加齒輪損耗與維修介面。|A gearbox lowers generator torque but adds gear losses and maintenance interfaces.|以相同軸功率比較 10 rpm 與 1,000 rpm，列出轉矩的 100 倍差異。|At equal shaft power compare 10 and 1,000 rpm and the 100-fold torque difference.
分辨參考風機與產品|Separate reference models from products|公開參考風機用於可重現研究，不等於商用製造圖。|An open reference turbine enables reproducible research, not commercial fabrication.|把參考模型的轉速、控制器與柔性假設列成表，標記不可直接移植的輸入。|Tabulate speed, controller and flexibility assumptions and flag inputs that cannot transfer directly.
核對極數與頻率|Relate poles and frequency|同步機電頻率 f=pn/60，其中 p 是極對數。|For a synchronous machine f=pn/60 with p pole pairs.|假設 60 極對、10 rpm，算得 10 Hz；不要誤用總極數 120。|For 60 pole pairs at 10 rpm obtain 10 Hz; do not substitute the 120 total poles.
建立銅損熱路|Build a copper-loss thermal path|銅損隨 RMS 電流平方增加，冷卻入口溫度影響繞組餘裕。|Copper loss scales with RMS current squared; coolant inlet temperature consumes winding margin.|將電流增至 1.1 倍，預測定電阻銅損 1.21 倍，再加入電阻溫升效應。|Raise current by 10%, predict 1.21 times copper loss at fixed resistance, then add temperature dependence.
追蹤磁鐵與氣隙|Track magnets and air gaps|轉子偏心可造成非對稱磁拉力；平均氣隙相同仍可能有局部熱點。|Eccentricity produces unbalanced magnetic pull; equal mean gaps can still hide local hot spots.|比較均勻氣隙與偏心模型的周向磁密，保留最大值而不只平均值。|Compare circumferential flux density for uniform and eccentric gaps, retaining peaks rather than only means.
協調變流器容量|Coordinate converter capacity|全功率變流器須同時考慮有功、無功與電流限制。|A full-power converter must satisfy active, reactive and current limits together.|以 S=√(P²+Q²) 算 P=8 MW、Q=6 Mvar 的 10 MVA 需求。|Use S=√(P²+Q²) to obtain 10 MVA for 8 MW and 6 Mvar.
分析鹽霧與凝露|Analyze salt and condensation|海洋濕度和鹽分降低絕緣可靠度，外殼防護與內部濕控角色不同。|Marine humidity and salt threaten insulation; enclosure protection and internal humidity control serve different roles.|在環境矩陣加入停機冷卻與復機升溫，標記露點跨越的時段。|Add shutdown cooling and restart warming to an environmental matrix and mark dew-point crossings.
追蹤電纜機電介面|Trace cable electromechanical interfaces|浮式平台移動使動態電纜承受疲勞，額定電流無法表示彎曲壽命。|Floating motion fatigues dynamic cables; ampacity does not express bending life.|把平台運動頻譜與電纜曲率輸出對照，另列導體溫度。|Compare platform motion spectra with cable curvature output and separately list conductor temperature.
辨識軸承電流|Identify bearing-current paths|共模電壓可經寄生電容形成軸承電流，不能只靠機械振動診斷。|Common-mode voltage can drive bearing current through parasitic capacitance; vibration alone is insufficient.|畫出機殼、軸、軸承與接地回路，對照共模頻谱。|Draw the frame, shaft, bearing and grounding path and compare its common-mode spectrum.
對齊負載與驗證|Align load cases and validation|額定點效率不代表全風速區間能量產出。|Rated-point efficiency does not establish annual energy across wind speeds.|用三個假設風速區間的時數加權輸出，與額定功率乘全年時數比較。|Weight three hypothetical wind-speed bins by hours and compare with rated power times annual hours.
交付整合介面表|Deliver integration interfaces|機械、電氣、冷卻與通訊限制必須在同一版本配置下相容。|Mechanical, electrical, cooling and communication limits must match one configuration revision.|製作介面失配案例：變流器限流降額後重算熱負載及功率承諾。|Create a mismatch case: after converter current derating, recompute heat and promised output.
''')

C(237,'背對背變流器、直流匯流排與故障穿越的能量協調','energy coordination of back-to-back converters, DC links and fault ride-through',
'拓樸與座標|電流與直流|故障與保護|證據與交付','Topology and frames|Current and DC link|Faults and protection|Evidence and delivery',
'wind5 windcollection windconverter','a236 a223','wind',
'教學例：C=20 mF 的直流電容從 1,000 V 升至 1,100 V，ΔE=C(V₂²−V₁²)/2=2.10 kJ。若機側比網側多輸入 100 kW，只需約 21 ms 累積這份能量，忽略損耗。',
'Teaching example: a 20 mF DC capacitor rising from 1,000 to 1,100 V stores ΔE=C(V₂²−V₁²)/2=2.10 kJ. A 100 kW machine-to-grid power imbalance accumulates this in about 21 ms, neglecting losses.',
'穿越曲線、無功優先與跳脫時限須取自實際併網規範；本課不提供現場保護設定。','Ride-through curves, reactive-current priority and trip delays come from the actual grid code; this course does not prescribe field protection settings.',r'''
比較 DFIG 與全功率拓樸|Compare DFIG and full converters|雙饋機轉子變流器處理滑差功率；全功率機將全部電功率經變流器。|A DFIG rotor converter processes slip power; a full converter processes all electrical power.|以 0.2 滑差作量級比較，並指出轉子暫態電流不能僅用平均滑差估算。|Use slip 0.2 for an order-of-magnitude comparison and flag rotor transient current as a separate constraint.
畫出背對背能量路徑|Draw back-to-back energy paths|機側與網側變流器由直流儲能耦合，瞬間功率可不相等。|Machine and grid converters couple through DC energy storage; instantaneous powers may differ.|在同一時間軸畫 P機、P網與電容能量斜率，檢查能量符號。|Plot machine power, grid power and capacitor-energy slope on one time axis and check signs.
定義 dq 方向|Define dq sign conventions|相序、Park 角度及電流方向決定有功無功符號。|Phase sequence, Park angle and current reference direction determine active/reactive signs.|先讓 d 軸對齊電網電壓，再用單位功率因數三相電流驗證 q 軸分量近零，記錄尺度。|Align the d axis to grid voltage, then use unity-power-factor currents to verify a near-zero q component and record scaling.
配置電流迴路|Configure current loops|電感與採樣延遲共同限制電流迴路頻寬。|Inductance and sampling delay jointly limit current-loop bandwidth.|掃描延遲 1 與 2 個採樣週期，對照超越量和相位裕度。|Sweep one and two sample periods of delay and compare overshoot and phase margin.
核對直流過壓|Check DC overvoltage|DC 電壓是功率失衡的積分結果，網側跌壓會減少可輸送功率。|DC voltage integrates power imbalance; a grid dip can reduce export capacity.|用本課 21 ms 算例對照模擬上升時間，改變電容看比例。|Compare a simulated rise with the 21 ms example and vary capacitance to check scaling.
處理限幅與反積分飽和|Handle limits and anti-windup|電流限幅後若積分器繼續累積，恢復時會出現長時間超越。|An integrator that grows during current saturation can produce prolonged recovery overshoot.|對相同跌壓比較有無反積分飽和的復原波形。|Compare recovery from the same voltage dip with and without anti-windup.
區分低電壓穿越與跳脫|Separate ride-through and tripping|故障期間留在線上和立即切離各有條件，不可用單一低壓值決策。|Remaining connected and tripping depend on different conditions, not one undervoltage number.|以明示為示意的電壓—時間包絡分類三個事件，另列規範待查欄。|Classify three events against an explicitly illustrative voltage-time envelope and list code checks still needed.
分配有功與無功電流|Allocate active/reactive current|圓形電流限制內增加無功電流會壓縮有功電流餘裕。|Increasing reactive current inside a circular limit reduces active-current headroom.|Imax=1 pu、Iq=0.6 pu 時算 Id 上限 0.8 pu，對照優先權策略。|For Imax=1 pu and Iq=0.6 pu calculate an Id limit of 0.8 pu and compare priority policies.
建模制動耗能|Model braking dissipation|制動支路處理短時多餘能量，不能取代持續功率平衡。|A braking path absorbs temporary excess energy, not an indefinite imbalance.|用功率—時間積分計算一次事件能量，與重複事件冷卻間隔分開列示。|Integrate power over one event and distinguish its energy from repeated-event cooling intervals.
檢查共模與絕緣|Check common mode and insulation|PWM 快速邊沿影響共模位移電流，即使基波電壓合格。|Fast PWM edges affect common-mode displacement current even with acceptable fundamental voltage.|以 i=C·dv/dt 比較寄生電容加倍時的電流趨勢，標明非理想寄生。|Use i=C·dv/dt to compare doubled parasitic capacitance and label the parasitic model.
驗證保護分層|Validate layered protection|硬體快速保護、控制降額與系統切離具有不同反應尺度。|Fast hardware protection, control derating and system isolation act on different timescales.|建立微秒、毫秒、秒三層時序圖，查找責任重疊和空窗。|Create microsecond, millisecond and second timelines and locate overlap and unprotected gaps.
整理故障可追溯性|Assemble fault traceability|只有跳脫碼不足以分辨電網事件、感測失真與元件故障。|A trip code alone cannot distinguish grid events, sensing errors and device failures.|對齊故障前後相電流、DC 電壓、門極狀態及時戳，寫出可否定假說。|Align phase current, DC voltage, gate state and timestamps around an event and write a falsifiable hypothesis.
''')

C(238,'海纜電容、集電拓樸、熱額定與選擇性保護','subsea-cable capacitance, collector topology, thermal ratings and selective protection',
'拓樸與負載|電纜與無功|故障與可用率|驗證與擴充','Topology and load|Cables and reactive power|Faults and availability|Validation and expansion',
'windcollection wind15 shore','a237 a208','wind',
'教學例：平衡三相 30 MW、66 kV、功率因數 0.95，I=P/(√3·VLL·PF)=276.2 A。每相 R=0.6 Ω 時總銅損 3I²R≈137.3 kW；忽略充電電流後的結果不能直接用於長海纜選型。',
'Teaching example: balanced 30 MW at 66 kV and power factor 0.95 gives I=P/(√3·VLL·PF)=276.2 A. At R=0.6 Ω per phase, total copper loss 3I²R≈137.3 kW. Neglecting charging current makes this insufficient for long-cable selection.',
'集中參數模型只適合對應頻段與長度；暫態、局部放電及海床熱阻須用專用模型與量測。','Lumped models apply only within their frequency and length range; transients, partial discharge and seabed thermal resistance need dedicated models and measurements.',r'''
界定串列與環網|Distinguish radial and ring collection|環網可增加切換路徑，但備援價值取決於開關位置和容量。|A ring adds switching paths, but redundancy depends on switch locations and capacities.|移除一段假設電纜，逐支路重算可供電風機與瓶頸。|Remove a hypothetical cable segment and recompute reachable turbines and branch bottlenecks.
套用同時率與潮流|Apply coincidence and load flow|平均風場功率不能替代各支路最不利流量。|Average farm output does not replace worst-case branch flows.|比較全場均風和局部強風兩種出力表，保留逆向流量。|Compare uniform and spatially uneven wind-output tables and retain reverse flows.
統一電壓基準|Unify voltage bases|線電壓、相電壓與標么基準混用會造成 √3 倍錯誤。|Mixing line, phase and per-unit voltage bases creates √3 errors.|用 66 kV 線電壓重算本課電流，再以相電壓驗證同一結果。|Recalculate the example using 66 kV line voltage, then verify using phase voltage.
建立海纜 π 模型|Build a cable pi model|串聯阻抗與並聯電容共同決定電壓和充電無功。|Series impedance and shunt capacitance jointly determine voltage and charging VARs.|比較空載與滿載接收端電壓，勿把空載電流視為量測錯誤。|Compare unloaded and loaded receiving voltage; do not dismiss no-load current as measurement error.
估算充電無功|Estimate charging reactive power|三相電纜總充電無功可寫 Q≈ωC相VLL²。|Total three-phase charging VARs are approximately Q=ωCphaseVLL².|50 Hz、C相=2 μF、66 kV 時得約 2.74 Mvar，註明 C 是每相全長值。|At 50 Hz, Cphase=2 μF and 66 kV obtain about 2.74 Mvar; C is full-length per-phase capacitance.
檢查海床熱路|Check seabed thermal paths|導體發熱經絕緣、護套與海床散出，埋深及土壤熱阻影響載流量。|Heat traverses insulation, sheath and seabed; burial and soil thermal resistance affect ampacity.|保持銅損相同，將外部熱阻加倍，比較穩態導體溫升。|At fixed copper loss double external thermal resistance and compare conductor-temperature rise.
評估護套與接地|Assess sheaths and grounding|護套感應電壓與循環電流依接地配置改變，不能只看主導體。|Sheath-induced voltage and circulating current depend on bonding, not only the main conductor.|在回路圖上獨立標出護套電流，確認其損耗有進入熱模型。|Mark sheath currents separately and verify that their losses enter the thermal model.
協調故障選擇性|Coordinate fault selectivity|保護應辨識故障區段，同時考慮變流器限制故障電流。|Protection must identify the faulted section while accounting for converter-limited fault current.|比較同步電源與限流變流器的故障波形，檢查原判據是否失效。|Compare synchronous-source and current-limited converter fault traces and challenge the original criterion.
計算維修可用率|Calculate repair availability|海況等待時間可能主導電纜故障停機，備件數不能消除天候限制。|Weather waiting can dominate cable outage time; spare inventory does not remove weather limits.|把發現、動員、天候等待、修復四段時數分列，評估降低哪段最有效。|Separate detection, mobilization, weather wait and repair hours and identify the most useful reduction.
檢驗諧振與諧波|Examine resonance and harmonics|電纜電容與變壓器、電抗器電感可構成諧振。|Cable capacitance can resonate with transformer or reactor inductance.|用 f≈1/(2π√LC) 比較補償電感前後峰值位置，再要求頻率掃描。|Use f≈1/(2π√LC) to compare peaks before/after compensation, then require a frequency scan.
比較 N−1 承載|Compare N−1 loading|一條支路故障後轉供可能超過另一條熱額定，拓樸連通不代表可行。|After a branch outage, rerouting may exceed another thermal limit; connectivity is not feasibility.|按同一假設出力跑正常與 N−1 潮流，列出首個越限支路。|Run normal and N−1 flows at the same assumed output and list the first overloaded branch.
交付海陸介面|Deliver offshore/onshore interfaces|電壓品質、保護通訊、光纖和維修條件構成完整集電介面。|Voltage quality, protection communication, fiber and repair constraints jointly define the collector interface.|把電氣單線圖與通訊中斷情境對照，區分監控失聯和能源中斷。|Compare the single-line diagram with communication-loss cases and distinguish lost telemetry from lost power.
''')

C(239,'水力儲能、可變速機組與抽發模式切換的控制邊界','hydraulic storage, variable-speed machines and pumping/generation control boundaries',
'水能與機組|電氣與調節|切換與限制|調度與驗證','Water and machinery|Electrical regulation|Transitions and limits|Dispatch and validation',
'pumped pumpedchapter storage','a202 a222','storage',
'教學例：ρ=1,000 kg/m³、有效水量 10⁶ m³、平均水頭 100 m，位能 ρgVH=981 GJ=272.5 MWh。發電效率 90% 時得 245.25 MWh；抽水效率 90% 時需 302.78 MWh，往返效率 81%。',
'Teaching example: ρ=1,000 kg/m³, usable volume 10⁶ m³ and mean head 100 m give ρgVH=981 GJ=272.5 MWh. At 90% generating efficiency output is 245.25 MWh; at 90% pumping efficiency input is 302.78 MWh, yielding 81% round-trip efficiency.',
'水頭和效率隨工況改變；本課只做離線調度與狀態機分析，不是水輪機現場啟停程序。','Head and efficiency vary with operating point; this is offline dispatch and state-machine analysis, not a field turbine starting procedure.',r'''
定義有效庫容|Define usable reservoir volume|總庫容不等於可用儲能量，運轉水位上下限限制有效體積。|Gross reservoir volume differs from usable storage because water-level limits bound volume.|以庫容—水位表裁去不可用水位，重新積分位能。|Trim unusable levels from a volume-elevation table and reintegrate potential energy.
處理變動水頭|Account for changing head|水頭下降時，相同流量的水力功率也下降。|At constant flow, falling head reduces hydraulic power.|用 P=ρgQH 比較水頭 100 與 80 m，預測功率下降 20%。|Use P=ρgQH for 100 and 80 m heads and predict a 20% power reduction.
區分固定速與可變速|Distinguish fixed and variable speed|可變速機組提供額外抽水調節自由度，但受水力運轉區限制。|Variable speed adds pumping control freedom but remains bounded by hydraulic operating regions.|在示意泵曲線上標記固定速工作點與可變速範圍。|Mark fixed-speed points and variable-speed regions on illustrative pump curves.
畫出雙饋電氣路徑|Draw doubly-fed electrical paths|轉子頻率調節可改變機械轉速而維持定子電網頻率。|Rotor-frequency control changes mechanical speed while retaining stator grid frequency.|為正負滑差畫功率方向，避免把所有轉子功率視為損耗。|Draw power directions for positive/negative slip; do not classify all rotor power as loss.
建立功率與水位調節|Build power and level regulation|快速電氣控制和較慢水位控制有不同時間尺度。|Fast electrical regulation and slower reservoir-level control operate on different timescales.|分別繪出秒級功率追蹤與小時級水位變化，避免用同一採樣率判斷。|Plot second-scale power tracking and hour-scale level changes separately rather than judge both at one sample rate.
核對無功能力|Check reactive capability|電機視在功率限制使有功和無功服務相互牽制。|Machine apparent-power limits couple real-power and reactive-power services.|對 100 MVA 機組假設 P=80 MW，計算理想 Q 餘裕 60 Mvar，另註熱限制。|For an assumed 100 MVA machine at 80 MW compute an ideal 60 Mvar margin and separately note thermal limits.
構建模式狀態機|Construct the mode state machine|停機、抽水和發電之間有互鎖條件，不能以單一功率指令跳轉。|Stopped, pumping and generating modes have interlocks; a power command alone cannot trigger transitions.|在離線狀態圖標出允許及禁止轉移，讓缺失回授保持等待狀態。|Mark allowed and prohibited transitions in an offline state chart and keep missing feedback in a waiting state.
辨識水錘耦合|Identify water-hammer coupling|快速流量變化可激發管路壓力暫態，電氣快速響應並非越快越好。|Rapid flow changes excite pressure transients; faster electrical response is not always better.|比較緩慢與急速功率斜坡的假設壓力曲線，標記峰值及振盪。|Compare illustrative pressure traces under slow and fast power ramps and mark peaks and oscillations.
保留抽發禁區|Preserve forbidden operating zones|水力振動、汽蝕和穩定性禁區不能靠電流控制消除。|Current control cannot remove hydraulic vibration, cavitation or unstable operating regions.|把效率圖、振動禁區與調度需求疊合，找出不可接受交集。|Overlay efficiency maps, vibration exclusions and dispatch demand and identify invalid intersections.
核算往返效率|Audit round-trip efficiency|往返效率是抽水與發電效率乘積，還要計入輔機及待機損失。|Round-trip efficiency multiplies pumping and generating efficiencies and includes auxiliaries/standby losses.|重算本課 81% 例，增加 5 MWh 輔機用電後比較定義一致的效率。|Recompute the 81% example with 5 MWh auxiliary input, keeping numerator and denominator definitions consistent.
比較電網服務|Compare grid services|能量搬移、頻率調節及備轉需要不同的功率和能量餘裕。|Energy shifting, frequency regulation and reserve require different power and energy margins.|同時列出 MW 上限、MWh 剩餘及模式轉換延遲，挑出無法兌現的服務。|List MW limit, remaining MWh and mode-transition delay together and identify undeliverable services.
驗證調度回放|Validate dispatch replay|時序調度若忽略庫容上下限會產生虛假的收益或供能。|Ignoring reservoir bounds in time-series dispatch creates fictitious value or delivered energy.|回放 24 小時假設排程，每步檢查水量守恆並標記越限時刻。|Replay a hypothetical 24-hour schedule, checking water conservation and flagging every limit violation.
''')

C(240,'潮流可預測性、雙向水流與海洋電力調節','predictable tides, reversing flow and marine power conditioning',
'資源與轉子|整流與儲能|併網與海纜|監控與證據','Resource and rotor|Rectification and storage|Grid and cable|Monitoring and evidence',
'emectidal emechistory windcollection','a238 a243','marine',
'教學例：海水密度 1,025 kg/m³、掃掠面積 100 m²、流速 2 m/s，流體功率 ρAv³/2=410 kW；假設 Cp=0.40、發電鏈效率 0.90，輸出 147.6 kW。流速反向需另處理轉子控制，不代表負的可採能量。',
'Teaching example: seawater density 1,025 kg/m³, swept area 100 m² and speed 2 m/s give flow power ρAv³/2=410 kW. Assuming Cp=0.40 and conversion efficiency 0.90 gives 147.6 kW. Flow reversal requires rotor-control treatment, not negative harvestable energy.',
'潮汐週期可預測不表示短時功率不變；湍流、海況及環境限制另需評估，無水下作業指令。','Predictable tides do not imply constant short-term power; turbulence, sea state and environmental constraints need separate assessment, with no underwater work instructions.',r'''
區分潮差與潮流|Distinguish range and stream energy|攔壩潮差系統與自由流潮流轉子採用不同能量模型。|Barrage tidal-range systems and free-stream rotors use different energy models.|把位能 ρgVH 與動能流 ρAv³/2 對應到正確系統。|Match ρgVH and ρAv³/2 to their appropriate systems.
重建潮流時間序列|Reconstruct tidal-flow series|可預測潮週期仍含大潮小潮與局部湍流變動。|Predictable tidal cycles still include spring-neap variation and local turbulence.|以正弦流速作示意，先取速率絕對值再算立方功率，保留停潮時段。|Use an illustrative sine velocity, cube its absolute speed for power and retain slack-water intervals.
設計反向流情境|Design reversal scenarios|可雙向發電需處理轉子迎流方向與控制策略，電網頻率由變流器解耦。|Bidirectional harvesting requires rotor orientation/control treatment; the converter decouples grid frequency.|在流速過零前後分別標出轉矩、轉速、功率方向而不強迫三者同號。|Around zero flow mark torque, speed and power signs separately rather than force identical signs.
匹配發電機整流|Match generator and rectifier|變速發電機的電壓頻率隨轉速改變，整流器需涵蓋運轉包絡。|Variable-speed generator voltage/frequency change with speed; the rectifier must cover that envelope.|比較低流速與高流速的輸入包絡，標记 DC 升壓需求。|Compare input envelopes at low/high flow and mark where DC boosting is needed.
配置直流能量緩衝|Allocate DC energy buffering|電容只適合短時功率平衡，不能自然跨越長停潮區間。|Capacitance supports short power imbalance, not inherently long slack-water intervals.|以 20 kW 缺口持續 15 分鐘算 5 kWh，與電容的焦耳級儲能比較。|A 20 kW deficit for 15 minutes is 5 kWh; compare it with capacitor energy in joules.
限制轉矩變化率|Limit torque slew|電氣轉矩階躍會改變軸系負載，最快電流響應不一定是最佳海機控制。|Electrical torque steps change drivetrain loads; the fastest current response may not suit the marine machine.|在相同能量需求下比較斜坡與階躍轉矩的峰值軸扭矩。|For equal energy demand compare peak shaft torque under ramped and stepped torque.
整合海底電纜|Integrate subsea cables|海纜同時帶來導體損耗、充電電流與通訊介面。|Subsea cables add conductor loss, charging current and communication interfaces.|畫出發電機至岸上變電站的電氣與光纖兩條路徑。|Draw separate electrical and fiber paths from generator to onshore substation.
檢查弱網穩定性|Check weak-grid stability|小島電網阻抗可能使鎖相與電流控制相互耦合。|Island-grid impedance can couple PLL and current-control dynamics.|掃描電網等效電感，記錄振盪頻率與阻尼變化。|Sweep equivalent grid inductance and record oscillation frequency and damping.
規劃環境停機限制|Plan environmental curtailment|環境監測可能約束發電時間，電力預測應保留此非電氣限制。|Environmental monitoring may constrain operating hours; power forecasts must retain this non-electrical limit.|在發電時序加入一段假設保護停機，重算可供能而不改寫資源流速。|Insert a hypothetical environmental curtailment interval and recompute deliverable energy without altering resource velocity.
辨識感測器漂移|Identify sensor drift|海洋污染附著和感測器漂移可把資源下降與設備退化混淆。|Marine fouling and sensor drift can confound reduced resource with equipment degradation.|對照獨立流速、轉速和電功率訊號，測試單一感測器偏移假說。|Compare independent flow, speed and electrical-power signals and test a single-sensor bias hypothesis.
比較氫能與電池介面|Compare hydrogen and battery interfaces|電池緩衝與電解槽消納有不同最小功率、斜率和效率限制。|Battery buffering and electrolysis have different minimum power, slew and efficiency constraints.|把同一潮流出力序列分別送入兩種限制模型，計算被棄能量。|Feed the same tidal output into two constraint models and calculate curtailed energy.
以測試場證據交付|Deliver with test-site evidence|公開測試場資料支持系統介面理解，不代表所有潮機性能相同。|Public test-site material supports interface understanding, not identical performance across tidal devices.|使用 EMEC 場址資料標記電網介面，再把本課假設與官方場址數值分欄。|Use EMEC information to mark grid interfaces and separate teaching assumptions from published site values.
''')

C(241,'儲能電池、功率變流器與能源管理的分層整合','layered battery, power-converter and energy-management integration',
'容量與拓樸|直流與變流|管理與限制|試驗與交付','Capacity and topology|DC and conversion|Management and limits|Tests and delivery',
'storage bms storageperformance','a242 a223','storage',
'教學例：2 MWh 名目電池只在 SOC 10–90% 間運轉，可用 DC 能量 1.6 MWh；若放電鏈效率 95%，AC 交付約 1.52 MWh。以 1 MW 定功率可維持 1.52 h，尚未計入溫度與老化降額。',
'Teaching example: a 2 MWh nominal battery operated between 10% and 90% SOC offers 1.6 MWh DC energy. At 95% discharge-chain efficiency it delivers about 1.52 MWh AC, or 1.52 hours at 1 MW, before temperature and aging derating.',
'容量、消防、併網與建築條件均需專案審核；本課是離線系統整合模型，不提供電池櫃施工與帶電測試程序。','Capacity, fire response, interconnection and building conditions need project review; this is an offline integration model, not cabinet construction or energized testing.',r'''
區分 MW 與 MWh|Distinguish MW and MWh|功率限制瞬時輸出，能量限制持續時間，兩者不可互換。|Power limits instantaneous output; energy limits duration; they are not interchangeable.|比較 1 MW/4 MWh 與 4 MW/1 MWh 面對相同 2 MW 負載的可行性。|Compare 1 MW/4 MWh and 4 MW/1 MWh systems serving the same 2 MW load.
安排串並聯層級|Arrange series-parallel hierarchy|串聯提高電壓、並聯增加容量，但單體差異會限制整串。|Series raises voltage and parallel raises capacity, while cell mismatch can limit a string.|用 100 串、2 並、3.2 V/100 Ah 假設單體算 320 V、200 Ah、64 kWh。|For hypothetical 3.2 V/100 Ah cells in 100s2p compute 320 V, 200 Ah and 64 kWh.
界定可用能量窗口|Bound usable energy|名目能量不是可交付 AC 能量，SOC 窗口與效率需順序計入。|Nominal energy is not deliverable AC energy; SOC window and efficiency enter sequentially.|重算本課 1.52 MWh 例，再把 SOC 上限降至 80% 比較。|Recompute the 1.52 MWh example and compare after lowering the upper SOC to 80%.
建立預充概念模型|Build a precharge concept model|DC 電容連接瞬間的電壓差會造成衝擊，控制須辨識充電完成證據。|A voltage difference across a DC capacitor creates inrush; control needs evidence of charging completion.|離線模擬 RC 充電至 3τ 約 95%，明示這不是現場接線時間設定。|Simulate RC charging to about 95% at 3τ and state that this is not a field timing setting.
整合 PCS 能力曲線|Integrate PCS capability curves|P²+Q²≤S² 只是理想容量邊界，電壓與溫度還會限流。|P²+Q²≤S² is only an ideal capacity boundary; voltage and temperature also limit current.|將功率圓與兩個降額工況疊合，找出不能提供的無功承諾。|Overlay a power circle with two derated cases and identify unavailable VAR commitments.
追蹤輔機用電|Track auxiliary demand|空調、控制和待機消耗可顯著影響低利用率儲能效率。|Cooling, controls and standby loads can materially affect low-utilization efficiency.|10 kW 輔機運作 24 h 消耗 240 kWh，另列入能量帳而不藏入電池容量。|A 10 kW auxiliary load over 24 hours consumes 240 kWh; show it explicitly in the energy ledger.
分離 BMS 與 EMS|Separate BMS and EMS roles|BMS 保護元件限制，EMS 安排調度；高層指令不能凌駕安全限制。|The BMS enforces component limits while the EMS schedules energy; dispatch cannot override limits.|在訊息序列加入 BMS 低溫充電禁止，檢查 EMS 如何降額。|Insert a BMS cold-charge prohibition into a message trace and verify EMS derating.
管理 SOC 不確定度|Manage SOC uncertainty|SOC 估測有誤差，接近邊界時需保留能量餘裕。|SOC is estimated with uncertainty, requiring margin near operating bounds.|將 SOC=20%±3% 轉成能量區間，以保守端檢查備轉承諾。|Convert 20%±3% SOC into an energy interval and test reserve delivery at the conservative end.
建立異常隔離矩陣|Build a fault-isolation matrix|單串故障與全站緊急停機的影響範圍不同。|A single-string fault and plant emergency stop have different scopes.|移除一串後重算可用功率、能量及不平衡，保留故障紀錄。|Remove one string and recompute power, energy and imbalance while retaining the event record.
計算往返效率邊界|Calculate round-trip boundaries|AC–AC、DC–DC 和單次放電效率有不同量測邊界。|AC–AC, DC–DC and discharge-only efficiency use different measurement boundaries.|對同一能量紀錄畫出三種計量邊界，禁止混用分子分母。|Draw three metering boundaries for one energy record and avoid mixing numerators/denominators.
規劃性能回放|Plan performance replay|調頻波形與長時定功率測試對熱和容量施加不同負担。|Regulation profiles and long constant-power tests impose different thermal and capacity burdens.|回放同能量但不同峰值的兩個功率序列，對比 RMS 電流。|Replay equal-energy profiles with different peaks and compare RMS current.
交付版本與證據|Deliver configuration and evidence|同一測試結果只適用於對應韌體、電池批次及設定版本。|A test result applies to its firmware, battery batch and configuration revision.|建立需求—模型—紀錄對照，標出只靠模擬而尚未實證的條目。|Build requirement/model/record traceability and flag items supported only by simulation.
''')

C(242,'單體量測、SOC 估測、均衡與分層保護','cell measurements, SOC estimation, balancing and layered protection',
'量測與接線模型|估測與均衡|保護與通訊|故障與驗證','Measurements and wiring models|Estimation and balancing|Protection and communication|Faults and validation',
'bms bmsbalance storage','a241 a268','storage',
'教學例：100 Ah 電池放電 10 A、30 分鐘，理想電量減少 5 Ah，SOC 下降 5 個百分點。若電流偏移 +0.1 A 持續 10 h，積分誤差 1 Ah=1 個百分點；不能以更多顯示小數消除此偏差。',
'Teaching example: a 100 Ah battery discharged at 10 A for 30 minutes loses ideally 5 Ah, or 5 percentage points SOC. A +0.1 A current offset for 10 hours integrates to 1 Ah, or 1 percentage point; more display decimals do not remove this bias.',
'保護門檻依電芯化學、溫度、廠商與設計而異；不提供可直接燒錄的通用電池保護設定。','Protection thresholds depend on chemistry, temperature, supplier and design; no universal flashable protection settings are provided.',r'''
標記單體與電池組|Label cells and packs|包電壓正常仍可能包含一顆過高或過低的單體。|Normal pack voltage can hide one high or low cell.|用四顆電壓總和相同、分布不同的兩組資料比較風險。|Compare two four-cell datasets with equal total voltage but different distributions.
建立量測誤差預算|Build a measurement error budget|偏移、增益、參考源與溫漂對單體判讀有不同影響。|Offset, gain, reference and temperature drift affect cell interpretation differently.|將 ±2 mV 偏移和 0.1% 增益誤差在 4 V 下分項估算。|Estimate ±2 mV offset and 0.1% gain error separately at 4 V.
檢查斷線可觀測性|Check open-wire observability|取樣線斷開可能留下貌似合理的電容殘留值，不能只靠範圍檢查。|An open sense wire can leave plausible capacitive readings; range checks alone may miss it.|在合成資料注入凍結通道，對照相鄰單體與時間變化。|Inject a frozen channel into synthetic data and compare adjacent cells and time variation.
積分庫侖計量|Integrate coulomb counting|SOC 由帶符號電流積分更新，容量和效率假設需寫明。|SOC updates from signed current integration with explicit capacity and efficiency assumptions.|重算 10 A、30 分鐘例，將採樣時間由秒轉小時檢查單位。|Recompute the 10 A, 30-minute example and check conversion of sampling time from seconds to hours.
評估開路電壓校正|Assess open-circuit calibration|OCV–SOC 曲線受化學與溫度影響，負載下端電壓不是 OCV。|OCV–SOC curves depend on chemistry and temperature; loaded terminal voltage is not OCV.|對比同 SOC 的靜置與負載電壓，指出內阻壓降造成的誤判。|Compare rested and loaded voltage at the same SOC and identify internal-resistance error.
比較被動與主動均衡|Compare passive and active balancing|被動均衡耗散能量；主動均衡轉移能量但增加轉換與控制複雜度。|Passive balancing dissipates energy; active balancing transfers it with added conversion/control complexity.|以 4 V、50 mA 被動支路算 0.2 W，估算 0.1 Ah 差異需約 2 h。|For 4 V and 50 mA compute 0.2 W and about 2 hours to remove a 0.1 Ah difference.
分離故障檢測與處置|Separate detection and response|偵測到過流、通報主控與斷開能量路徑是不同動作。|Detecting overcurrent, notifying the controller and interrupting energy are distinct actions.|把感測延遲、判斷延遲和致動延遲相加，畫出最壞反應時間。|Sum sensing, decision and actuation delays and plot worst-case response time.
解讀溫度梯度|Interpret temperature gradients|單一表面溫度無法證明每顆電芯內部溫度相同。|One surface temperature cannot establish uniform internal cell temperature.|用三點溫度與電流紀錄比較熱滯後，標記未觀測區域。|Compare thermal lag using three temperature points and current data, marking unobserved regions.
保護通訊完整性|Protect communication integrity|CRC 可檢查傳輸錯誤，但不表示數值真實或時間新鮮。|CRC detects transmission corruption but does not prove measurement truth or freshness.|建立 CRC 正確但時戳過期的封包，驗證接收端拒絕過期控制。|Create a CRC-valid stale packet and verify that the receiver rejects stale control data.
估測 SOH 與阻抗|Estimate SOH and impedance|容量衰退與內阻增加是不同健康維度，不應壓成一個無定義分數。|Capacity fade and resistance growth are different health dimensions, not one unspecified composite score.|以 ΔV/ΔI 算脈衝等效電阻，並註明時間窗、SOC 和溫度。|Calculate pulse resistance from ΔV/ΔI and state its window, SOC and temperature.
回放感測故障|Replay sensing faults|偏移、卡值和掉包在正常負載下可能不易區分。|Bias, stuck values and dropped packets can be hard to distinguish under steady load.|在同一電流序列分別注入三種故障，列出每種可用的獨立證據。|Inject the three fault types into one current trace and list independent evidence for each.
交付參數可追溯性|Deliver parameter traceability|保護參數需連回電芯資料、版次與審查，不能照抄其他電池。|Protection parameters must trace to cell data, revision and review, not another battery pack.|建立只含示意參數的追溯表，對每個未知門檻標記待驗證。|Build a trace table with illustrative parameters only and mark every unknown threshold for validation.
''')

C(243,'液流電池電化學、泵浦輔機與雙向電力介面','flow-battery electrochemistry, pump auxiliaries and bidirectional interfaces',
'電解液與堆疊|泵流與功率|轉換與控制|效率與驗證','Electrolyte and stacks|Pumping and power|Conversion and control|Efficiency and validation',
'flow storage dab','a241 a265','storage',
'教學例：假設堆疊輸出 100 kW、泵浦與輔機共 6 kW、PCS 效率 96%，AC 淨輸出=(100−6)×0.96=90.24 kW。輔機從哪一側供電會改變能量帳，必須先畫邊界。',
'Teaching example: assume 100 kW stack output, 6 kW pump/auxiliary load and 96% PCS efficiency. Net AC output=(100−6)×0.96=90.24 kW. The accounting changes with auxiliary supply location, so draw the boundary first.',
'電解液種類、堆疊阻抗與泵流條件依系統而異；本課無化學配製、壓力管路或現場通電程序。','Electrolyte chemistry, stack impedance and flow conditions are system-specific; no chemical preparation, pressure-piping or field energization procedures are provided.',r'''
分開功率與能量設計|Separate power and energy sizing|儲液量主要影響能量，堆疊面積與數量主要影響功率，但泵和電壓仍耦合。|Tank inventory mainly influences energy and stacks influence power, with pumping and voltage coupling remaining.|比較同堆疊配兩種槽量的持續時間，指出不能因此任意倍增功率。|Compare duration for one stack with two tank sizes and explain why power cannot simply double.
標記氧化還原回路|Label redox loops|正負電解液回路和電子外電路共同形成電化學能量轉換。|Positive/negative electrolyte loops and the external electronic circuit jointly enable conversion.|畫出離子、電子和液流三種路徑，不用單一箭頭混合。|Draw separate ionic, electronic and fluid paths instead of one combined arrow.
建立堆疊電壓包絡|Build stack-voltage envelopes|端電壓隨 SOC、電流和溫度改變，轉換器不能只按名目值設計。|Terminal voltage varies with SOC, current and temperature; nominal voltage alone is insufficient.|用三個假設 SOC 的電壓曲線形成最小—最大輸入包絡。|Form a minimum/maximum input envelope using curves at three assumed SOC levels.
估算泵浦輔功|Estimate pump power|泵浦輸入約 ΔpQ/η，增加流量會增加輔機損耗。|Pump input is approximately ΔpQ/η; increasing flow raises auxiliary demand.|Δp=100 kPa、Q=0.01 m³/s、η=0.5 時算 2 kW。|For Δp=100 kPa, Q=0.01 m³/s and η=0.5 obtain 2 kW.
比較電流與流量|Compare current and flow|高電流需求若未配合反應物流量，可能增加濃差極化。|High current without adequate reactant flow can increase concentration polarization.|在合成極化曲線上比較兩種流量的高電流壓降。|Compare high-current voltage loss for two flow rates on synthetic polarization curves.
記錄靜置損耗|Record idle losses|待機泵流策略、跨膜傳輸和旁路電流都可能降低可回收能量。|Standby pumping, crossover and shunt currents can reduce recoverable energy.|把待機 8 小時的電耗與電量損失分列，不只報堆疊效率。|Separate electricity consumption and charge loss over 8 idle hours instead of reporting stack efficiency alone.
選擇双向拓樸|Choose a bidirectional topology|充放電電壓範圍與隔離需求決定 buck-boost 或隔離轉換的適配。|Charge/discharge voltage range and isolation needs determine converter suitability.|讓 DC 匯流排高於或低於堆疊兩種情境，標出需要升壓的方向。|Consider DC-bus voltages above and below stack voltage and identify boost directions.
限制電流斜率|Limit current slew|堆疊電流命令需配合流體與控制動態，不應視為理想電壓源。|Stack current commands must respect fluid/control dynamics rather than assume an ideal voltage source.|比較瞬時功率命令與斜坡命令下的最低單體電壓。|Compare minimum cell voltage under step and ramp power commands.
協調堆疊不平衡|Coordinate stack imbalance|並聯堆疊阻抗差異可造成分流不均，平均站電流會掩蓋它。|Parallel-stack impedance differences cause unequal sharing hidden by average plant current.|用兩支路電阻 1 與 1.2 pu 計算分流比例，追蹤支路熱負載。|For branch resistances 1 and 1.2 pu calculate current sharing and track branch heating.
分解能量效率|Decompose energy efficiency|庫侖效率、電壓效率與輔機效率描述不同損失。|Coulombic, voltage and auxiliary efficiencies describe different losses.|以 0.98×0.85 算堆疊 83.3%，再另計 PCS 和泵。|Multiply 0.98×0.85 for 83.3% stack efficiency, then account separately for PCS and pumps.
回放長時調度|Replay long-duration dispatch|長時儲能需在整個放電窗口維持堆疊、泵及溫度限制。|Long-duration service must sustain stack, pump and temperature limits throughout discharge.|回放 6 小時假設需求，逐段檢查最低堆疊電壓和輔功。|Replay a hypothetical 6-hour demand and check minimum stack voltage and auxiliaries in every segment.
交付物料與能量帳|Deliver material and energy ledgers|液體庫存和電量紀錄需分別守恆，兩者不一致提示模型邊界缺失。|Fluid inventory and charge records need separate conservation checks; disagreement flags missing boundaries.|建立槽液量、電流積分、泵耗和 AC 能量的四欄對帳。|Reconcile four columns: liquid inventory, integrated charge, pump consumption and AC energy.
''')

C(244,'電容量、ESR、串聯均壓與脈衝功率分配','capacitance, ESR, series balancing and pulse-power allocation',
'能量與阻抗|串聯與均壓|功率與控制|寿命與驗證','Energy and impedance|Series and balancing|Power and control|Life and validation',
'supercap storage current','a242 a259','storage',
'教學例：100 F 模組從 48 V 放至 36 V，可用 E=C(Vmax²−Vmin²)/2=50,400 J=14 Wh；不是用 48 V×100 F 得能量。若 ESR=20 mΩ、電流 100 A，瞬時壓降 2 V、熱損 200 W。',
'Teaching example: a 100 F module discharged from 48 to 36 V provides E=C(Vmax²−Vmin²)/2=50,400 J=14 Wh. Voltage times farads is not energy. With ESR=20 mΩ at 100 A, the immediate drop is 2 V and heating is 200 W.',
'等效 RC 只描述選定時間尺度；漏電、溫度及老化必須另量測，教學假設不是充電安全限值。','An equivalent RC model describes only selected timescales; leakage, temperature and aging need separate measurement, and examples are not safe charging limits.',r'''
區分電荷與能量|Distinguish charge and energy|Q=CV 與 E=CV²/2 描述不同物理量，放電能量隨電壓平方變化。|Q=CV and E=CV²/2 describe different quantities; discharge energy depends on voltage squared.|重算本課 14 Wh，再比較放到 24 V 時可用能量。|Recompute the 14 Wh example and compare usable energy when discharging to 24 V.
建立 ESR 壓降|Model ESR voltage drop|端電壓包含電容電壓與 I·ESR，脈衝邊沿可立即下跌。|Terminal voltage includes capacitor voltage and I·ESR, causing an immediate pulse-edge drop.|在 100 A 階躍的合成波形分開 2 V 跳變與後續線性斜率。|Separate the 2 V jump from the later linear slope in a synthetic 100 A step trace.
估測有效電容量|Estimate effective capacitance|恆流下 C=IΔt/ΔV，但需排除 ESR 瞬時壓降。|Under constant current C=IΔt/ΔV, excluding the instantaneous ESR drop.|用 10 A、10 s、1 V 漸變算 100 F，说明量測窗口。|Use 10 A, 10 seconds and 1 V gradual change to obtain 100 F and define the window.
計算串聯等效|Calculate series equivalents|相同 N 顆串聯容量變 C/N、ESR 變 N·R，電壓分配仍需管理。|N identical series cells yield C/N and N·R ESR; voltage sharing still needs management.|比較兩顆 200 F、10 mΩ 串聯後的 100 F、20 mΩ。|Verify that two 200 F, 10 mΩ cells in series yield 100 F and 20 mΩ.
辨識漏電不一致|Identify leakage mismatch|串聯長時間均壓由漏電與均衡回路決定，不能只看相同容量。|Long-term series voltage sharing depends on leakage and balancing, not equal capacitance alone.|在兩個漏電不同的 RC 模型中比較静置末端單體電壓。|Compare final idle cell voltages for two RC models with different leakage.
比較均壓損耗|Compare balancing losses|被動均壓電阻持續耗能，主動均壓需額外控制與轉換。|Passive balancing resistors continuously dissipate power; active methods add conversion/control.|以 2.5 V、100 Ω 算 62.5 mW，累積 24 小時的能耗。|For 2.5 V and 100 Ω compute 62.5 mW and integrate over 24 hours.
匹配脈衝時間|Match pulse duration|功率密度高不表示長時續航，脈衝能量仍受電壓窗口限制。|High power density does not imply long runtime; pulse energy remains voltage-window limited.|以 5 kW 放電本課 14 Wh，理想持續約 10.08 s，另扣損耗。|At 5 kW the example’s 14 Wh lasts ideally 10.08 seconds before losses.
配置雙向 DC 介面|Configure a bidirectional DC interface|電容電壓大幅改變時，DC/DC 能維持負載匯流排但增加電流。|A DC/DC stage maintains the load bus as capacitor voltage falls, at the cost of increased input current.|固定 1 kW，比較 48 V 與 24 V 的理想輸入電流 20.8 與 41.7 A。|At fixed 1 kW compare ideal input currents of 20.8 A at 48 V and 41.7 A at 24 V.
分配電池與電容功率|Split battery and capacitor power|低頻能量交給電池、高頻脈衝交給電容是控制策略，仍受雙方限制。|Assigning slow energy to batteries and fast pulses to capacitors is a strategy bounded by both devices.|對負載序列做低通分解，再檢查電容 SOC 是否逐次漂移。|Low-pass split a load sequence, then check whether capacitor state drifts over repeated pulses.
建立 RMS 熱損|Build RMS heating losses|ESR 熱損由 RMS 電流決定，平均電流零仍可發熱。|ESR heating depends on RMS current; zero average current can still generate heat.|對 ±50 A 等時脈衝算平均 0 A、RMS 50 A 及 I²R。|For equal-duration ±50 A pulses compute 0 A mean, 50 A RMS and I²R heating.
追蹤老化指標|Track aging indicators|容量下降與 ESR 上升分別限制能量和脈衝功率。|Capacitance loss and rising ESR limit energy and pulse power differently.|將容量減 20%、ESR 加倍的模型與新件比較最低端電壓。|Compare minimum terminal voltage for a model with 20% lower capacitance and doubled ESR against a new device.
驗證重複脈衝|Validate repeated pulses|單次脈衝成功不證明重複運轉的溫度與電壓可復原。|One successful pulse does not prove thermal and voltage recovery in repeated operation.|回放 100 次離線脈衝，保留峰溫、最低電壓及充回時間。|Replay 100 offline pulses and retain peak temperature, minimum voltage and recharge time.
''')

C(245,'旋轉動能、雙向電機與飛輪損耗管理','rotational energy, bidirectional machines and flywheel loss management',
'能量與轉速|電機與軸承|控制與母線|損耗與驗證','Energy and speed|Machine and bearings|Control and bus|Losses and validation',
'flywheel magnetic storage','a260 a259','storage',
'教學例：轉動慣量 J=10 kg·m²，轉速由 10,000 降至 5,000 rpm，ΔE=J(ω₁²−ω₂²)/2≈4.112 MJ=1.142 kWh。速度減半後仍有四分之一初始能量；高轉速同時提高轉子應力。',
'Teaching example: with J=10 kg·m² and speed falling from 10,000 to 5,000 rpm, ΔE=J(ω₁²−ω₂²)/2≈4.112 MJ=1.142 kWh. Halving speed leaves one quarter of initial energy; high speed also increases rotor stress.',
'飛輪破裂、真空與軸承失效有重大實體風險；僅做離線能量及控制建模，不提供轉子製造或超速測試程序。','Rotor burst, vacuum and bearing failures are significant physical hazards; this is offline energy/control modeling, not rotor fabrication or overspeed testing.',r'''
轉換 rpm 與角速度|Convert rpm and angular speed|旋轉能量公式使用 rad/s，不可直接代入 rpm。|Rotational energy uses rad/s, not rpm directly.|將 10,000 rpm 乘 2π/60 得 1,047.2 rad/s，檢查平方單位。|Convert 10,000 rpm using 2π/60 to 1,047.2 rad/s and check squared units.
界定可用轉速窗口|Bound the usable speed window|最低轉速由功率轉換與控制限制決定，不一定可降至零。|Minimum speed is constrained by conversion/control and may not reach zero.|以本課上下轉速算可用能量，與從最高轉速降到零的理論值比較。|Calculate usable energy over the example’s speed window and compare with the theoretical energy down to zero.
分析慣量分布|Analyze inertia distribution|相同質量放在不同半徑有不同慣量與結構應力。|Equal mass at different radii produces different inertia and structural stress.|比較薄環 J=mr² 與實心圓盤 J=mr²/2，明示幾何理想化。|Compare thin-ring J=mr² and solid-disc J=mr²/2, stating idealized geometry.
匹配電機轉矩包絡|Match the torque envelope|定功率放電時轉速降低會使所需轉矩增加。|At constant discharge power, falling speed requires increasing torque.|用 T=P/ω 比較同 10 kW 下高低轉速的兩倍轉矩需求。|Use T=P/ω to compare a twofold torque demand between high and low speed at 10 kW.
分辨電磁與機械限制|Separate electromagnetic and mechanical limits|電流限制、反電勢限制與轉子應力限制互不等價。|Current, back-EMF and rotor-stress limits are not equivalent.|在轉矩—轉速圖各標一條限制，取交集而非單一額定點。|Mark each limit on a torque-speed diagram and use their intersection rather than one rating.
連結磁浮軸承|Link magnetic bearings|主動磁浮需要位置回授與持續控制，低摩擦不表示無輔功。|Active magnetic bearings need position feedback and continuous control; low friction does not mean zero auxiliaries.|將軸承控制用電加入待機能耗，另列備援支承的功能。|Add bearing-controller power to standby energy and separately identify backup support functions.
協調雙向功率|Coordinate bidirectional power|充電電動與放電發電需要一致的轉矩、轉速、DC 電流符號。|Motoring charge and generating discharge require consistent torque, speed and DC-current signs.|以正轉速下正負轉矩兩種狀態驗證 P=Tω 與 DC 功率平衡。|At positive speed test positive/negative torque against P=Tω and DC power balance.
管理母線過壓|Manage bus overvoltage|負載突然減少時仍旋轉的飛輪可向母線送能，需控制能量去向。|After a load drops, the rotating flywheel can continue feeding the bus, requiring energy-path control.|模擬功率指令階躍下降，追蹤 DC 電容能量與限流響應。|Simulate a falling power command and track DC capacitor energy and current limiting.
設計速度估測交叉檢查|Cross-check speed estimation|編碼器讀值與電機電頻率應符合極對數關係，但各有故障模式。|Encoder speed and electrical frequency should follow pole-pair scaling, but have distinct failure modes.|以 4 極對、6,000 rpm 預測 400 Hz，注入漏脈波觀察不一致。|For four pole pairs at 6,000 rpm predict 400 Hz and inject missed pulses to reveal inconsistency.
分離風阻與電損|Separate windage and electrical loss|待機轉速衰減包含軸承、風阻與電磁損耗，不能全歸電池式自放電。|Idle speed decay includes bearing, windage and electromagnetic losses, not one battery-style self-discharge term.|由正值耗散功率 P損=−Jω·dω/dt 估計停轉減速損耗，比較不同速度區間。|Estimate positive rundown loss as P_loss=−Jω·dω/dt and compare speed regions.
計算短時功率價值|Calculate short-duration capability|高循環功率服務與長時能量服務需不同容量配置。|High-cycle power services and long-duration energy services require different sizing.|以本課 1.142 kWh 比較 10 kW 和 100 kW 理想持續時間。|Compare ideal durations at 10 kW and 100 kW using the example’s 1.142 kWh.
交付失效與停機模型|Deliver failure and rundown models|控制電源失效時機械能仍存在，停機不能只看主接觸器狀態。|Mechanical energy remains after control-power failure; shutdown is not defined by contactor state alone.|建立離線能量殘留時間線，列出無法由目前感測證明的狀態。|Build an offline residual-energy timeline and list states not provable with available sensing.
''')

C(246,'UPS 拓樸、儲能續航、旁路與負載相容性','UPS topologies, runtime, bypass and load compatibility',
'負載與拓樸|儲能與轉换|旁路與保護|可靠度與驗證','Loads and topology|Storage and conversion|Bypass and protection|Reliability and validation',
'ups upstopology datacenter','a247 a244','storage',
'教學例：負載 8 kW、功率因數 0.8，需 10 kVA；這不代表 10 kVA UPS 一定能提供 10 kW。若可用電池能量 4 kWh、逆變效率 0.90，理想續航 4×0.90/8=0.45 h=27 分鐘。',
'Teaching example: an 8 kW load at power factor 0.8 requires 10 kVA; a 10 kVA UPS does not necessarily support 10 kW. With 4 kWh usable battery energy and 90% inverter efficiency, ideal runtime is 4×0.90/8=0.45 hours=27 minutes.',
'負載相容、轉換時間、短路保護及電池曲線需按選定設備驗證；本課不作帶電旁路操作指導。','Validate load compatibility, transfer time, fault protection and battery curves for selected equipment; this course does not guide energized bypass operations.',r'''
建立負載清單|Build a load inventory|額定 W、VA、浪湧及峰值因數分別限制供電能力。|Watts, VA, inrush and crest factor impose different supply constraints.|以 8 kW、0.8 PF 例建立 W/VA 雙欄，另列啟動峰值。|Build separate W/VA columns for the 8 kW, 0.8 PF example and list startup peaks separately.
比較備援式與在線式|Compare standby and online UPS|不同拓樸的正常功率路徑與電池轉移條件不同。|Topologies differ in normal power paths and battery-transfer conditions.|用三張原創方塊圖比較待機、在線互動及雙轉換路徑。|Use three original block diagrams to compare standby, line-interactive and double-conversion paths.
檢查負載保持時間|Check load hold-up time|負載能否跨越短暫轉移取決於其自身保持時間與波形容忍。|Surviving a short transfer depends on the load’s own hold-up time and waveform tolerance.|對 8 ms 轉移與 5、15 ms 假設負載保持時間分類風險。|Compare an 8 ms transfer with hypothetical 5 and 15 ms load hold-up times.
估算電池續航|Estimate battery runtime|固定 kWh 算例忽略高倍率、低溫與老化，不能取代廠商續航曲線。|A fixed-kWh estimate omits rate, cold and aging effects and cannot replace runtime curves.|重算 27 分鐘例後施加 20% 容量降額，得到 21.6 分鐘。|Apply 20% capacity derating to the 27-minute example to obtain 21.6 minutes.
核算雙轉換效率|Audit double-conversion efficiency|兩級效率相乘，輕載與滿載效率可能不同。|Two conversion efficiencies multiply and can differ between light/full load.|以整流 0.97、逆變 0.96 算 93.12%，再加入輔機固定用電。|Multiply 0.97 rectifier and 0.96 inverter efficiencies for 93.12%, then add fixed auxiliaries.
管理充電恢復|Manage recharge recovery|放電後恢復時間受充電器、電池接受能力與負載共享限制。|Recharge time depends on charger, battery acceptance and shared load capacity.|3 kWh 能量缺口、1 kW 理想充電需至少 3 h，指出吸收尾段使時間更長。|A 3 kWh deficit at ideal 1 kW charging needs at least 3 hours; note a longer taper stage.
區分靜態與維修旁路|Distinguish static and maintenance bypass|靜態旁路處理轉移，維修旁路提供維修路徑，功能和互鎖不同。|Static bypass handles transfers; maintenance bypass provides a maintenance path with different interlocks.|在離線單線圖標出每條路徑是否仍經 UPS 電力轉換。|Mark on an offline single-line whether each route still passes through UPS conversion.
核對旁路同步|Check bypass synchronization|頻率、相位與電壓不相容時，無縫轉移不能假設成立。|Seamless transfer cannot be assumed with incompatible frequency, phase or voltage.|比較 0° 與 30° 相位差的兩組假設電壓，說明差電壓。|Compare hypothetical voltage pairs at 0° and 30° phase displacement and explain their difference voltage.
分析選擇性保護|Analyze selective protection|逆變器限流可能不同於市電故障電流，原斷路器配合需重新評估。|Inverter-limited fault current differs from utility fault current, requiring protection review.|對同一故障比較正常旁路與電池模式可提供的故障電流曲線。|For one fault compare available fault-current curves in bypass and battery modes.
計算模組備援|Calculate module redundancy|N+1 是在定義負載和單模組降額後仍可承載，不能只數機箱。|N+1 means sustaining defined load after module derating and a failure, not simply counting cabinets.|四台 20 kW 模組供 50 kW，移除一台後算剩餘 60 kW，再施加環境降額。|Four 20 kW modules serve 50 kW; remove one for 60 kW remaining, then apply environmental derating.
辨識共同失效|Identify common failures|多台 UPS 仍可能共享旁路、電池室或控制依賴。|Multiple UPS units can still share bypass, battery-room or control dependencies.|在故障樹標出共同節點，避免把其故障率當獨立相乘。|Mark shared nodes in a fault tree instead of multiplying their failure probabilities as independent.
驗證負載階躍|Validate load steps|穩態電壓合格不足以證明瞬變負載的供電品質。|Acceptable steady voltage does not establish transient-load performance.|對合成 20%→80% 負載階躍記錄最低電壓、恢復時間和模式變換。|For a synthetic 20%-to-80% step record voltage minimum, recovery time and mode changes.
''')

C(247,'A/B 配電、容量備援、共同失效與運維證據','A/B distribution, redundant capacity, common failures and operational evidence',
'負載與路徑|配電與保護|備援與維護|能效與驗證','Loads and paths|Distribution and protection|Redundancy and maintenance|Efficiency and validation',
'datacenter datacenterdc ups','a246 a221','storage',
'教學例：一櫃 12 kW 雙電源負載正常平均由 A/B 各供 6 kW，但任一路失效後另一側須承接 12 kW。若把每側只按 6 kW 配置，兩路標籤不會產生備援。',
'Teaching example: a 12 kW dual-cord rack normally takes 6 kW from each A/B path, but either 剩餘路徑 must carry 12 kW after the other fails. Rating each path at only 6 kW does not create redundancy.',
'可靠度分類、接地及現場切換須按工程規範與合格專業審核；課程只評估離線拓樸。','Reliability classification, grounding and field switching require applicable engineering review; the course evaluates offline topologies only.',r'''
盤點單電源與雙電源|Inventory single and dual cords|雙路上游供電無法自動使單電源設備具備雙路接入。|Dual upstream power does not automatically give single-cord equipment dual input.|在機櫃清單標出單電源例外與所需轉移裝置介面。|Mark single-cord exceptions and transfer-device interfaces in a rack inventory.
畫出 A/B 端到端路徑|Trace end-to-end A/B paths|備援需從來源到負載保持可用，任一共享節點可能取消路徑獨立性。|Redundancy must persist from source to load; a shared node can remove independence.|以不同線型追到同一變壓器或開關，圈出意外共享節點。|Trace distinct paths back to transformers/switches and circle unintended common nodes.
核算故障後容量|Calculate post-failure capacity|正常分攤不等於故障承載， 剩餘路徑 要按故障後總負載計。|Normal sharing differs from fault loading; the 剩餘路徑 must carry post-fault demand.|重算 12 kW 機櫃範例，連續增加機櫃直到首個支路越限。|Recompute the 12 kW rack example and add racks until the first branch overloads.
平衡三相負載|Balance three-phase demand|相電流不平衡和中性線諧波影響配電，總 kW 不足以描述。|Phase imbalance and neutral harmonics matter; total kW is insufficient.|對三相 10、8、6 kW 清單重新分配機櫃，保留支路限制。|Rebalance a 10, 8, 6 kW phase inventory while preserving branch constraints.
比較 AC 與 DC 架構|Compare AC and DC architectures|減少轉換級數可能降損，但 DC 故障切離、接地與旁路需另設計。|Fewer conversion stages can reduce loss, but DC interruption, grounding and bypass need separate design.|畫出兩種架構的故障電流路徑，指出不能直接沿用的 AC 假設。|Draw fault-current paths for both architectures and identify AC assumptions that do not transfer.
協調上下游保護|Coordinate upstream/downstream protection|支路故障應盡量由最近保護清除，但 UPS 限流會影響選擇性。|A branch fault should be isolated locally where possible, but UPS current limits affect selectivity.|以示意時間—電流曲線找出重疊區，標為待專業驗證。|Find overlap in illustrative time-current curves and mark it for professional verification.
比較 N+1 與 2N|Compare N+1 and 2N|模組容量備援和兩套獨立路徑解決不同故障問題。|Spare module capacity and two independent systems address different failures.|移除一模組和一整條配電路徑，分別檢查兩種架構。|Remove one module and one full distribution path and test both architectures separately.
建模維護情境|Model maintenance cases|能承受故障不表示維護期間仍有相同備援裕度。|Fault tolerance does not imply equal reserve during maintenance.|先停用一條維護路徑，再加入單故障，追蹤失電負載。|Disable a maintenance path first, then inject one fault and trace lost loads.
分析控制與燃料依賴|Analyze control and fuel dependencies|共用控制網、發電機燃料或冷卻會形成跨電力路徑共同失效。|Shared controls, generator fuel or cooling can couple otherwise separate power paths.|將非電氣依賴加到故障樹，重新判斷路徑独立性。|Add non-electrical dependencies to the fault tree and reassess path independence.
區分 PUE 與供電效率|Separate PUE and power efficiency|PUE 包含冷卻等設施能耗，不等於 UPS 效率。|PUE includes facility loads such as cooling and is not UPS efficiency.|總設施 1.4 MW、IT 1 MW 算 PUE=1.4，另報 UPS 轉換損耗。|For 1.4 MW facility and 1 MW IT demand calculate PUE=1.4 and report UPS losses separately.
保留量測時間解析|Retain measurement time resolution|15 分鐘平均可能掩蓋秒級峰值與轉移事件。|A 15-minute average can hide second-scale peaks and transfers.|用同一事件計算秒級峰值與 15 分鐘平均，說明容量判讀差異。|Compute second-scale peak and 15-minute average for one event and explain sizing differences.
交付演練證據|Deliver exercise evidence|備援承諾需與具版本、負載及故障條件的測試證據相連。|Redundancy claims need test evidence tied to versions, load and fault conditions.|建立離線演練報告，列明失效前後路径、未覆蓋情境及資料缺口。|Create an offline exercise report with before/after paths, uncovered cases and data gaps.
''')

C(248,'燃料電池極化、輸入紋波與升壓控制','fuel-cell polarization, input ripple and boost regulation',
'堆疊與極化|拓樸與紋波|控制與緩衝|保護與效率','Stack and polarization|Topology and ripple|Control and buffering|Protection and efficiency',
'fuelcell hydrogen dab','a249 a244','storage',
'教學例：堆疊 100 V 供 20 kW 負載、轉換效率 95%，平均輸入 I=Pout/(ηVin)=210.5 A。若 Vin 下降到 80 V，同功率需 263.2 A，顯示把堆疊當理想電壓源會低估電流。',
'Teaching example: a 100 V stack supplies 20 kW at 95% converter efficiency, requiring I=Pout/(ηVin)=210.5 A. At 80 V the same output requires 263.2 A, showing why an ideal-voltage-source assumption understates current.',
'本課不涵蓋氫氣管線、燃料供應啟停或化學操作；堆疊限制以供應商資料及專業試驗為準。','Hydrogen piping, fuel-system startup and chemical operations are outside scope; stack limits require supplier data and professional tests.',r'''
讀取極化曲線|Read polarization curves|活化、歐姆與濃差損失在不同電流區間主導。|Activation, ohmic and concentration losses dominate different current regions.|在示意 V–I 曲線標出三區，計算每點 P=VI 而非只看電壓。|Mark three regions on an illustrative V–I curve and calculate P=VI at each point.
界定最小輸入電壓|Bound minimum input voltage|定功率下低電壓增加輸入電流，可能接近堆疊限制。|At constant power lower voltage increases input current and may approach stack limits.|比較本課 210.5 與 263.2 A，將電流上限疊到工作區。|Compare the example’s 210.5 and 263.2 A and overlay a current limit.
分開堆疊與系統效率|Separate stack and system efficiency|空壓、冷卻與控制輔機消耗會降低淨電力。|Air, cooling and control auxiliaries reduce net electrical output.|從 20 kW 輸出扣除假設 2 kW 輔機，另列其供電位置。|Subtract an assumed 2 kW auxiliary load from 20 kW and state its supply location.
推導理想升壓比|Derive ideal boost ratio|連續導通理想 boost 為 Vout=Vin/(1−D)，接近 D=1 時非理想更重要。|An ideal CCM boost has Vout=Vin/(1−D); nonidealities grow as D approaches one.|100 V 升至 400 V 算 D=0.75，列出損耗、死區和限流未納入。|For 100-to-400 V compute D=0.75 and list omitted loss, dead-time and current limits.
比較交錯相位|Compare interleaved phases|交錯可降低總輸入紋波，但抵消程度隨占空比改變。|Interleaving reduces total input ripple, with cancellation depending on duty ratio.|相加兩個相差半週期的三角電流，在不同 D 下比較剩餘紋波。|Add half-cycle-shifted triangular currents and compare residual ripple at different D.
限制反向電流|Limit reverse current|燃料電池一般不能像二次電池自由吸收回灌能量。|A fuel cell generally cannot absorb backfed energy like a rechargeable battery.|在母線回生情境標出獨立儲能或阻斷路徑，而非指令堆疊充電。|For regenerative bus energy identify storage/blocking paths rather than command stack charging.
協調慢速堆疊與快負載|Coordinate slow stack and fast load|反應物流與堆疊動態可慢於負載變化，緩衝元件處理差額。|Reactant and stack dynamics can lag load changes; buffers handle the mismatch.|對 10 kW、1 s 功率缺口算 10 kJ 緩衝需求。|For a 10 kW deficit lasting 1 second calculate 10 kJ buffer energy.
檢查輸入阻抗互動|Check input-impedance interaction|定功率轉換器具負增量輸入電阻傾向，可能影響源端穩定。|A constant-power converter tends toward negative incremental input resistance, affecting source stability.|由 I=P/V 比較電壓下降時電流上升，對照源阻抗。|Use I=P/V to show current rising as voltage falls and compare with source impedance.
建立電流斜率限制|Build current-slew limits|堆疊電流斜率限制應由系統能力決定，不可一味追求快速外環。|Stack current slew should reflect system capability, not simply maximize outer-loop speed.|在負載階躍模型加入斜率限制，記錄母線偏差與緩衝能量。|Add a slew limit to a load-step model and record bus deviation and buffer energy.
辨識低壓單體|Identify low-voltage cells|總堆疊電壓可能掩蓋個別單體異常，需按監測可觀測度判讀。|Stack voltage can hide a weak cell; interpretation depends on cell-level observability.|在單體資料中注入一顆低壓，檢查總和偏差是否足以發現。|Inject one low-voltage cell into cell data and test whether the total deviation reveals it.
核算導通與開關損耗|Audit conduction and switching loss|降低紋波可能增加元件數；提高頻率可減磁件但增加開關損耗。|Lower ripple may require more devices; higher frequency shrinks magnetics but increases switching losses.|比較 f 加倍時近似 E_sw f 損耗，另列電感體積與銅損。|Compare approximate E_sw f loss when frequency doubles and separately list inductor size/copper loss.
交付功率包絡|Deliver power envelopes|最大功率點、熱限制和暫態限制需共同決定可承諾輸出。|Maximum-power, thermal and transient limits jointly define deliverable output.|對每個輸入電壓列持續與短時功率，標示資料來源和未知項。|For each input voltage list continuous/short-term power with sources and unknowns.
''')

C(249,'電解槽極化、整流諧波與電流品質','electrolyzer polarization, rectifier harmonics and current quality',
'電化學負載|整流拓樸|電流與電網|效率與驗證','Electrochemical load|Rectifier topologies|Current and grid|Efficiency and validation',
'electrolysis electrolysistop hydrogen','a248 a266','storage',
'教學例：理想法拉第電量模型 nH₂=I·t/(2F)，I=1,000 A、t=3,600 s、F=96,485 C/mol，單電解單元約產 18.66 mol H₂；N 個串聯單元理想總量再乘 N。此例未計法拉第效率、氣體狀態和輔機。',
'Teaching example: ideal Faraday accounting gives nH₂=I·t/(2F). At 1,000 A for 3,600 s with F=96,485 C/mol, one cell produces about 18.66 mol H₂. N series cells multiply ideal total production by N. Faradaic efficiency, gas conditions and auxiliaries are excluded.',
'不提供製氫設備組裝、氣體處理與現場運轉程序；數值用於離線電量與電能核算。','No hydrogen equipment assembly, gas handling or field operation procedures are provided; numerical work is offline charge/energy accounting.',r'''
讀取電解槽 V–I 模型|Read electrolyzer V–I models|電解槽不是固定電阻，其極化電壓隨電流和狀態改變。|An electrolyzer is not a fixed resistor; polarization voltage changes with current and state.|比較線性電阻和帶起始電壓的模型，在低電流區指出差異。|Compare a resistor with a threshold-plus-polarization model and identify low-current differences.
應用法拉第核算|Apply Faraday accounting|產氫莫耳數與通過電量及效率相連，不直接由額定 kW 推出。|Hydrogen moles track charge and efficiency, not rated kW alone.|重算本課 18.66 mol 例，若效率 95% 則约 17.72 mol。|Recompute 18.66 mol and obtain about 17.72 mol at 95% Faradaic efficiency.
區分單元與堆疊|Separate cells and stacks|串聯單元電流相同、總電壓相加，而各單元都產生氫。|Series cells share current and add voltage, while each produces hydrogen.|用 10 個 2 V 單元示例算 20 V 堆疊，對照總功率與產量倍數。|For ten 2 V cells compute a 20 V stack and compare total power and production scaling.
比較六脈波整流|Compare six-pulse rectification|相控整流角改變平均 DC 電壓，同時影響無功和諧波。|Phase-control angle changes average DC voltage along with VARs and harmonics.|在連續電流理想模型 Vdc≈1.35VLLcosα 比較 α=0°、30°，註明換相重疊未計。|In ideal continuous-current Vdc≈1.35VLLcosα compare 0° and 30°, excluding commutation overlap.
分析多脈波相消|Analyze multipulse cancellation|相移變壓器可使特定諧波抵消，失配會降低效果。|Phase-shifting transformers cancel selected harmonics, with mismatch reducing cancellation.|對等幅反相諧波相加後，再加入 10% 幅值誤差觀察殘差。|Sum equal opposite harmonics, then add 10% amplitude mismatch and inspect residuals.
比較主動前端|Compare active front ends|主動整流可控制電流與無功，但增加開關、控制與濾波要求。|Active rectifiers control current and VARs but add switching, control and filtering requirements.|以相同 DC 輸出比較功率因數、紋波和開關損耗三軸權衡。|At equal DC output compare power factor, ripple and switching-loss tradeoffs.
安排兩級轉換|Arrange two-stage conversion|AC/DC 加 DC/DC 可分離電網電流與堆疊電流調節。|AC/DC plus DC/DC separates grid-current and stack-current regulation.|畫兩個控制迴路與中間電容，標記功率失衡的儲能位置。|Draw both control loops and the intermediate capacitor, locating energy during imbalance.
定義電流紋波|Define current ripple|峰對峰、RMS 與頻率譜是不同紋波描述，不能只報一個百分比。|Peak-to-peak, RMS and spectrum are distinct ripple measures, not one unspecified percentage.|對平均 1,000 A、正弦峰值 100 A 算 AC RMS=70.7 A 和 20% 峰對峰比。|For 1,000 A mean and 100 A sinusoidal amplitude compute 70.7 A AC RMS and 20% peak-to-peak ratio.
控制最小負載與斜率|Control minimum load and slew|堆疊容許負載區與升降斜率受電化學及系統條件限制。|Allowed stack loading and ramps depend on electrochemistry and system conditions.|將假設再生能源曲線裁到容許包絡，計算未能消納的能量。|Clip a hypothetical renewable profile to an allowed envelope and calculate unabsorbed energy.
核算 DC 與系統效率|Audit DC and system efficiency|整流效率不是製氫系統效率，還需堆疊電壓、產量和輔機。|Rectifier efficiency is not hydrogen-system efficiency; stack voltage, yield and auxiliaries also matter.|將 1 MW AC、0.97 MW DC、0.05 MW 輔機分欄，禁止重複扣除。|Separate 1 MW AC, 0.97 MW DC and 0.05 MW auxiliaries and avoid double subtraction.
評估模組並聯|Assess parallel modules|並聯模組需分流控制和故障隔離，數量增加不自動保證均流。|Parallel modules require sharing control and fault isolation; count alone does not ensure equal currents.|用兩個略有偏移的電壓環模型比較循環電流。|Compare circulating current for two voltage-loop models with small offsets.
整理量測與授權邊界|Organize measurement and scope|電功率紀錄支持電源驗證，不能單獨證明氣體純度或製程安全。|Electrical records support supply validation but cannot establish gas purity or process safety alone.|將驗收項目分為電氣可證與需要獨立製程證據兩欄。|Separate acceptance items into electrically provable claims and those needing independent process evidence.
''')

C(250,'岸船頻率轉換、接地介面與負載轉移','shore/ship frequency conversion, grounding interfaces and load transfer',
'岸船需求|轉換與電纜|介面與保護|品質與驗證','Shore/ship requirements|Conversion and cables|Interfaces and protection|Quality and validation',
'shore shoreguide datacenter','a246 a266','wind',
'教學例：船舶需 3 MW、功率因數 0.9，至少需 3.333 MVA。若船側線電壓 6.6 kV，平衡三相電流約 291.6 A；50 Hz 岸網轉 60 Hz 船網需真正頻率轉換，變壓器本身不會改變頻率。',
'Teaching example: 3 MW at power factor 0.9 requires at least 3.333 MVA. At 6.6 kV line voltage the balanced current is about 291.6 A. Converting a 50 Hz shore grid to a 60 Hz ship grid requires frequency conversion; a transformer alone does not change frequency.',
'船岸接線、接地、互鎖、同步與操作需合格港務及船舶專業規範；本課只做概念模型。','Connections, grounding, interlocks, synchronization and operations require qualified port/marine engineering; this course uses conceptual models only.',r'''
盤點船舶供電需求|Inventory ship demand|船舶電壓、頻率、相序與功率需求需分別匹配岸側能力。|Ship voltage, frequency, phase sequence and power must separately match shore capability.|以需求矩陣比較 50/60 Hz 和兩種船舶電壓，標示需轉換項目。|Compare 50/60 Hz and two ship voltages in a requirement matrix and mark conversion needs.
拆分變壓與變頻|Separate voltage and frequency conversion|變壓器改變電壓比，靜態頻率轉換器才處理頻率差。|Transformers change voltage ratio; static converters handle frequency differences.|在方塊圖將變壓器與 AC/DC/AC 分開，追蹤每端頻率。|Separate transformer and AC/DC/AC blocks and track frequency at every port.
計算視在功率|Calculate apparent power|無功與諧波使額定 kVA 不可只按平均 kW 配置。|Reactive power and harmonics mean rated kVA cannot follow average kW alone.|重算 3 MW、0.9 PF 範例，再檢查負載階躍餘裕。|Recompute the 3 MW, 0.9 PF example and check load-step margin.
建立電纜壓降|Model cable voltage drop|長岸電電纜阻抗與負載電流共同影響船端電壓。|Long-cable impedance and load current jointly affect ship voltage.|在平衡簡化模型比較半載與滿載壓降，分開 R 和 X 項。|Compare half/full-load drop in a balanced simplified model, separating R and X contributions.
處理繞纜熱條件|Account for cable thermal conditions|電纜盤繞與環境改變散熱，銘牌電流需對應安裝條件。|Reeling and ambient conditions change cooling; current ratings depend on installation.|對相同 I²R 比較散熱良好與受限的熱阻模型。|Compare good and constrained thermal-resistance models at equal I²R.
規劃負載斜坡|Plan load ramps|船側大型負載接入可擾動輸出電壓，須在轉換器能力內調節。|Large ship loads disturb output voltage and must remain within converter capability.|回放兩個負載階躍，記錄電流限幅、電壓最低值與復原。|Replay two load steps and record current limiting, voltage minimum and recovery.
辨識接地相容性|Identify grounding compatibility|岸網與船網接地方式可能不同，保護與共模路徑需一起評估。|Shore and ship grounding schemes may differ, requiring joint protection/common-mode assessment.|畫出隔離邊界和保護導體概念路徑，標明待規範確認項。|Draw conceptual isolation and protective-conductor paths and mark code-dependent items.
分析同步轉移條件|Analyze synchronized transfer conditions|並聯或轉移前的相位、電壓和頻率條件不同於穩態供電。|Phase, voltage and frequency conditions for paralleling/transfer differ from steady supply.|比較相位誤差隨時間累積，0.1 Hz 差頻在 1 s 產生 36°。|Compare accumulated phase error: 0.1 Hz mismatch produces 36° in one second.
建立互鎖狀態圖|Build interlock state diagrams|連接、許可、供電與斷開應依證據轉移，不靠單一按鈕假設成功。|Connection, permission, supply and disconnection states need evidence-based transitions.|用離線狀態圖注入通訊中斷，確保系統不誤報已安全連接。|Inject communication loss into an offline state chart and prevent false connected-state confirmation.
追蹤諧波來源|Trace harmonic sources|船上非線性負載可影響變流器及岸網，兩側諧波不能視為完全相同。|Nonlinear ship loads affect converters and shore networks; spectra on both sides need not match.|對照 AC/DC/AC 兩側頻譜，指出 DC 匯流排解耦與控制限制。|Compare spectra on both AC/DC/AC sides and explain DC-link decoupling and control limits.
核算減排邊界|Audit emissions boundaries|停用船上發電機降低港內排放，但全生命週期效益依岸電來源。|Stopping onboard generation lowers local port emissions; lifecycle benefit depends on electricity source.|以兩種假設電網排放係數比較同一岸電能量，標記非實測數據。|Compare one shore-energy demand under two assumed grid-emission factors, labeling them non-measured.
交付岸船責任表|Deliver shore/ship responsibility tables|港方、船方與設備商各自控制不同介面，責任缺口會破壞整合。|Port, ship and supplier control different interfaces; responsibility gaps undermine integration.|對每項頻率、保護、通訊和量測要求指定資料責任人類型。|Assign a responsible party type for frequency, protection, communication and metering requirements.
''')

C(251,'定轉子電磁結構、製造公差與電機驗證','stator/rotor electromagnetics, manufacturing tolerances and machine validation',
'電磁與材料|繞組與轉子|機械與熱|檢驗與交付','Electromagnetics and materials|Windings and rotor|Mechanics and heat|Inspection and delivery',
'induction motorassembly motorcontrol','a252 a257','motor',
'教學例：50 Hz、4 極感應馬達同步轉速 ns=120f/P=1,500 rpm；轉子 1,440 rpm 時滑差 s=(ns−n)/ns=0.04。若氣隙功率 10 kW，理想轉子銅損 sPg=0.4 kW，機械轉換功率 9.6 kW，尚未扣機械損耗。',
'Teaching example: at 50 Hz with four poles, ns=120f/P=1,500 rpm. At 1,440 rpm, slip s=(ns−n)/ns=0.04. For 10 kW air-gap power, ideal rotor copper loss sPg=0.4 kW and converted mechanical power is 9.6 kW before mechanical losses.',
'製造參數取決於材料與設計；本課為圖面、模擬和檢驗資料判讀，無帶電耐壓、加工與轉子超速指令。','Manufacturing parameters depend on materials and design; the course interprets drawings, simulations and inspection data, without energized withstand, machining or overspeed instructions.',r'''
辨識旋轉磁場|Identify rotating fields|三相對稱繞組產生旋轉磁場，極數和頻率決定同步轉速。|Balanced three-phase windings create a rotating field whose speed follows poles and frequency.|用 50 Hz 比較 2、4、6 極同步轉速 3000、1500、1000 rpm。|At 50 Hz compare 2, 4 and 6 poles: 3000, 1500 and 1000 rpm.
選擇疊片材料|Choose lamination materials|薄片與片間絕緣抑制渦流，但磁滯與加工損傷仍影响鐵損。|Thin insulated laminations suppress eddy currents, while hysteresis and processing damage still affect core loss.|比較同頻磁密下兩種供應商損耗曲線，不以片厚單獨排序。|Compare two supplier loss curves at equal frequency/flux instead of ranking by thickness alone.
配置槽極配合|Configure slots and poles|槽數和繞組分布影響基波繞組因數、諧波及轉矩脈動。|Slots and winding distribution affect fundamental winding factor, harmonics and torque ripple.|把兩種示意槽極配置的反電勢頻譜對照，不只看基波幅度。|Compare EMF spectra for two illustrative slot/pole layouts, not only fundamental amplitude.
核對導線截面|Check conductor cross section|電流密度與槽滿率受到散熱、絕緣厚度及製造公差共同限制。|Current density and slot fill depend on cooling, insulation thickness and process tolerances.|以 10 A、2 mm² 算 5 A/mm²，標為教學數值而非通用容許值。|For 10 A and 2 mm² calculate 5 A/mm², labeling it illustrative rather than universally allowable.
建立端部損耗|Model end-winding losses|端部導線不完全參與有效轉矩，仍增加電阻與熱負載。|End turns do not fully contribute useful torque but still add resistance and heat.|在相同有效導體長下增加端部長 20%，重算總電阻而非直接加總銅損 20%。|Increase end length by 20% at fixed active length and recompute total resistance rather than assume 20% total copper-loss increase.
分析鼠籠導條|Analyze cage bars|導條與端環形成閉合轉子電路，缺陷會改變電流分布。|Rotor bars and end rings form closed circuits; defects alter current distribution.|比較完整導條模型與一條高電阻導條的轉矩脈動。|Compare torque ripple for intact bars and one high-resistance bar.
定義氣隙公差|Define air-gap tolerances|偏心氣隙改變磁拉力與振動，平均尺寸合格不足以排除局部偏差。|Eccentric gaps change magnetic pull and vibration; mean dimensions do not exclude local deviation.|以周向多點氣隙圖計算最大最小值，保留角位置。|Calculate minimum/maximum gaps from a circumferential map and retain angular positions.
安排軸承與同心度|Arrange bearings and concentricity|軸承配合與軸系同心度影響振動和壽命，電磁合格不保證機械合格。|Bearing fits and concentricity affect vibration/life; electromagnetic success does not guarantee mechanical success.|將機械公差鏈與振動頻譜對照，提出不同於電磁諧波的假說。|Compare tolerance stackups with vibration spectra and propose a hypothesis distinct from electromagnetic harmonics.
建立溫升網路|Build temperature-rise networks|繞組、鐵心、機殼和冷卻有不同熱阻與時間常數。|Winding, core, frame and cooling paths have different thermal resistances/time constants.|同時繪出繞組快速升溫與機殼慢速升溫，避免用外殼代替熱點。|Plot fast winding and slow housing temperature rise together; do not substitute casing temperature for the hot spot.
運用滑差功率平衡|Use slip-power balance|轉子銅損佔氣隙功率的滑差比例，滑差不是整機全部損耗比例。|Rotor copper loss is slip times air-gap power; slip is not total machine loss fraction.|重算 4% 滑差例，再加入定子與風摩損做完整功率帳。|Recompute the 4% slip example, then add stator and friction/windage losses to complete the ledger.
解讀空載與負載資料|Interpret no-load and loaded data|空載、堵轉等試驗提供不同參數證據，單一效率點不能識別全部模型。|Different machine tests constrain different parameters; one efficiency point cannot identify the full model.|用供應商既有試驗表匹配等效電路參數，標出不可辨識的組合。|Fit an equivalent circuit to existing supplier test tables and mark unidentifiable combinations.
建立出廠追溯|Build manufacturing traceability|材料批次、繞組電阻、平衡與絕緣紀錄需對應同一序號。|Material lots, winding resistance, balance and insulation records must map to one serial number.|建立示例旅行單，對缺少量測版本的條目標示不得判定完成。|Build a sample traveler and withhold completion when measurement revision is missing.
''')

C(252,'永磁材料、轉子拓樸、反電勢與退磁餘裕','magnet materials, rotor topology, back-EMF and demagnetization margin',
'磁路與拓樸|繞組與組裝|熱與機械|量測與驗證','Magnetic circuits and topology|Windings and assembly|Thermal and mechanics|Measurement and validation',
'motorassembly motorcontrol magnetic','a251 a261','motor',
'教學例：採峰值 dq 電流慣例，表面永磁機 T=1.5pψfIq。p=4、ψf=0.08 Wb、Iq=50 A 時 T=24 N·m；3,000 rpm 時理想機械功率 Tω≈7.54 kW。RMS 電流慣例下不可直接照搬係數。',
'Teaching example using peak dq currents: a surface-PM machine has T=1.5pψfIq. With p=4, ψf=0.08 Wb and Iq=50 A, T=24 N·m; at 3,000 rpm ideal mechanical power is about 7.54 kW. Do not reuse the coefficient unchanged with RMS conventions.',
'磁鐵裝配、轉子保持及退磁驗證需材料與機械專業；本課無實體高速轉子製造或測試程序。','Magnet assembly, rotor retention and demagnetization validation need materials/mechanical expertise; no physical high-speed rotor fabrication/testing procedure is given.',r'''
比較表貼與內埋磁鐵|Compare surface and interior magnets|表貼與內埋拓樸在凸極性、磁阻轉矩及機械保持上不同。|Surface and interior PM rotors differ in saliency, reluctance torque and retention.|對兩種原創截面標出磁通與橋部，列出可與不可轉移的模型。|Mark flux and bridges on two original cross sections and list transferable and nontransferable models.
讀取磁鐵 B–H 曲線|Read magnet B–H curves|剩磁、矯頑力與溫度係數各自影響性能，磁鐵牌號不只是一個強度數字。|Remanence, coercivity and temperature coefficients affect different behaviors; a grade is not one strength number.|比較兩溫度退磁曲線與工作點，指出不可逆退磁風險方向。|Compare demagnetization curves and operating points at two temperatures and identify irreversible-risk direction.
建立極對數映射|Map pole pairs|電角度=極對數×機械角度，製造極性錯誤會破壞模型。|Electrical angle equals pole pairs times mechanical angle; polarity mistakes invalidate the model.|四極對轉子旋轉 45° 機械角，驗算 180° 電角。|For four pole pairs, verify that 45° mechanical equals 180° electrical.
配置繞組與相序|Configure windings and sequence|繞組相序和磁極方向共同決定反電勢及轉矩方向。|Winding sequence and magnetic polarity determine back-EMF and torque direction.|在離線三相反電勢資料交換兩相，觀察相序反轉。|Swap two phases in offline three-phase EMF data and observe sequence reversal.
評估齒槽轉矩|Assess cogging torque|無電流仍可能因磁能隨角度變化產生齒槽轉矩。|Cogging torque can exist without current because magnetic energy varies with angle.|比較空載角度—轉矩曲線與通電轉矩脈動，勿混為同一來源。|Compare unpowered torque-angle data with energized ripple without treating them as one source.
追蹤磁鐵保持介面|Trace magnet-retention interfaces|轉子膠接、套筒或橋部承担離心負載，電磁效率不能驗證保持力。|Adhesive, sleeve or bridges carry centrifugal loads; electromagnetic efficiency does not verify retention.|在需求表分開電磁、熱膨脹和結構證據，列出缺少的輸入。|Separate electromagnetic, thermal-expansion and structural evidence in a requirement table and list missing inputs.
建立銅鐵磁鐵損耗|Build copper/core/magnet losses|PWM 諧波可在磁鐵與轉子產生附加損耗，基波模型可能低估熱。|PWM harmonics can add magnet/rotor loss overlooked by fundamental models.|比較正弦與 PWM 電流頻譜下的損耗分項，不只看定子溫度。|Compare loss components under sinusoidal/PWM spectra rather than stator temperature alone.
分析退磁工況|Analyze demagnetization cases|高溫與反向磁場聯合作用可能使磁鐵越過退磁曲線拐點。|High temperature and opposing field together can cross the demagnetization knee.|用示意曲線比較熱態負 d 軸電流與常溫工況，標為待 FEA 驗證。|Compare hot negative-d current and room-temperature cases on illustrative curves, pending FEA validation.
檢查弱磁電壓界線|Check field-weakening voltage bounds|高轉速反電勢增加，負 d 軸電流可降低磁鏈但佔用電流能力。|Back-EMF rises with speed; negative d current weakens flux but consumes current capacity.|在電流圓上增加 abs(Id)，計算可剩餘 Iq，連到轉矩降額。|Increase abs(Id) on a current circle and calculate remaining Iq and torque derating.
解讀反電勢常數|Interpret back-EMF constants|線間/相值、峰值/RMS 及 rpm/rad/s 定義需統一才能比較 Ke。|Line/phase, peak/RMS and rpm/rad/s definitions must match when comparing Ke.|把一筆已標定義的 Ke 換算單位，列出 √3、√2 和 2π/60 因子來源。|Convert a defined Ke record and identify the origins of √3, √2 and 2π/60 factors.
核算轉矩常數|Audit torque constants|dq 尺度與電流定義改變轉矩公式係數，不能機械套用。|dq scaling and current definitions change torque-formula coefficients.|重算本課 24 N·m 與 7.54 kW，再以功率守恆交叉檢查。|Recompute 24 N·m and 7.54 kW and cross-check with power conservation.
交付製造與控制參數|Deliver manufacturing/control parameters|相電阻、電感、磁鏈與編碼器零位需對應同一成品。|Phase resistance, inductance, flux and encoder offset must refer to the same finished machine.|建立成品參數表，對溫度、量測頻率和角度基準逐項標記。|Create a finished-machine parameter table with temperature, test frequency and angle reference.
''')

C(253,'磁阻轉矩、相電流成形與換相區間','reluctance torque, phase-current shaping and commutation intervals',
'磁路與角度|功率級與電流|換相與轉矩|噪音與驗證','Magnetics and angle|Power stage and current|Commutation and torque|Noise and validation',
'srm motorcontrol current','a257 a255','motor',
'教學例：線性未飽和近似 T≈0.5i²dL/dθ。i=10 A、dL/dθ=0.02 H/rad 時 T≈1 N·m。角度若以度表示需先換為 rad；飽和時必須改用磁共能曲線，不可外推 i²。',
'Teaching example in the unsaturated linear approximation: T≈0.5i²dL/dθ. With i=10 A and dL/dθ=0.02 H/rad, T≈1 N·m. Angles must be in radians; saturation requires co-energy curves rather than extrapolating i².',
'磁路飽和、非線性和機械噪音不可由單一線性式充分描述；僅做模擬與公開資料判讀。','Magnetic saturation, nonlinearity and acoustic behavior exceed one linear equation; work is limited to simulation and public-data interpretation.',r'''
標記凸極結構|Identify doubly salient geometry|磁阻機轉子無永久磁鐵，轉矩來自磁路隨角度改變。|An SR rotor has no permanent magnets; torque arises from angle-dependent magnetic paths.|在對齊與未對齊兩張示意圖比較磁阻和電感方向。|Compare reluctance/inductance directions in aligned and unaligned sketches.
建立 L–θ 曲線|Build L–angle curves|在相同小電流下電感隨轉角改變，斜率符號決定線性轉矩方向。|At equal small current inductance varies with angle; slope sign sets linear-model torque direction.|對一條示意 L(θ) 曲線標出正、零、負斜率區。|Mark positive, zero and negative slope regions on an illustrative L(θ) curve.
使用磁共能|Use magnetic co-energy|飽和後磁鏈不再正比電流，需在固定電流下取共能對角度導數。|With saturation flux linkage is nonlinear in current; torque follows co-energy derivative at fixed current.|比較線性三角面積和彎曲 λ–i 曲線積分，指出誤差來源。|Compare linear triangular area with the integral of a curved λ–i relation and identify error.
辨識非對稱半橋|Identify asymmetric half bridges|每相獨立激磁、續流和退磁狀態提供電流調節自由度。|Independent excitation, freewheel and demagnetization states permit phase-current control.|在離線電路狀態表標記各狀態的繞組電壓符號。|Mark winding-voltage signs for each state in an offline circuit state table.
分析電流上升|Analyze current rise|v=Ri+dλ/dt，低電感未對齊區可能有更快電流上升。|v=Ri+dλ/dt; low-inductance unaligned regions can have faster current rise.|固定 V 和 R，比較兩個 L 值的初始 di/dt≈V/L。|At fixed V and R compare initial di/dt≈V/L for two L values.
追蹤退磁能量|Trace demagnetization energy|關斷後繞組能量需有回路釋放，電流不會瞬間歸零。|Stored winding energy needs a release path after turn-off; current cannot vanish instantly.|對照正負相電壓下的電流斜率，積分回到 DC 母線的能量。|Compare current slopes under positive/negative phase voltage and integrate energy returned to the bus.
安排導通角|Arrange turn-on angles|高速時電流建立需要提前角，不能只按最大電感位置通電。|At high speed current build-up needs advance; switching only at maximum inductance is inadequate.|在角度軸疊合目標轉矩區和有延遲的電流曲線。|Overlay the desired torque region and delayed current on an angle axis.
限制負轉矩尾流|Limit negative-torque tails|電流延伸到負 dL/dθ 區會造成制動轉矩。|Current extending into negative dL/dθ regions creates braking torque.|比較兩個退磁時刻的轉矩积分，保留負面積。|Compare torque integrals for two demagnetization timings, retaining negative area.
設計轉矩共享|Design torque sharing|相間重疊可降低總轉矩脈動，但受電流與磁耦合限制。|Phase overlap can reduce total ripple, bounded by current and magnetic coupling.|將兩相轉矩曲線相加，調整重疊區並觀察峰值電流。|Sum two phase-torque curves, adjust overlap and observe peak current.
解讀徑向力噪音|Interpret radial-force noise|可聞噪音常與徑向力和結構模態相關，不只由平均轉矩決定。|Audible noise relates to radial force and structural modes, not just mean torque.|將力頻譜峰值與假設結構共振頻率對照，區分激振與響應。|Compare force-spectrum peaks with assumed structural modes and distinguish excitation from response.
驗證位置誤差敏感度|Validate angle-error sensitivity|位置誤差使電流落在不同電感斜率區，改變轉矩和效率。|Position error shifts current into different inductance-slope regions, changing torque and efficiency.|掃描 ±5° 電角誤差，記錄平均轉矩及負轉矩比例。|Sweep ±5° electrical error and record mean torque and negative-torque fraction.
交付全速域模型|Deliver full-speed models|單一低速調整不保證高速退磁及供電裕度。|One low-speed tuning does not establish high-speed demagnetization or voltage margin.|建立速度×負載矩陣，標出電流、噪音和母線能量限制。|Build a speed/load matrix and mark current, acoustic and bus-energy limits.
''')

C(254,'直線力、熱負載、位置回授與機械模態','linear force, thermal load, position feedback and mechanical modes',
'行程與力|熱與電氣|回授與控制|精度與驗證','Travel and force|Thermal and electrical|Feedback and control|Precision and validation',
'linear encoder encoderfaq','a256 a257','motor',
'教學例：20 kg 移動負載需 2 m/s² 加速度、外力摩擦共 15 N，理想推力 F=ma+F外=55 N。若此推力占週期 25%、其餘無力，Frms=55√0.25=27.5 N；實際回程與保持力也必須納入。',
'Teaching example: moving 20 kg at 2 m/s² against 15 N external/friction force requires F=ma+Fexternal=55 N. If this force occupies 25% of a cycle with zero otherwise, Frms=55√0.25=27.5 N. Actual return and holding forces must also be included.',
'RMS 力只是熱估算的一部分，導軌、電纜拖鏈、碰撞及垂直軸安全另需專業設計。','RMS force is only part of thermal sizing; guides, cable chains, collision and vertical-axis safety need separate professional design.',r'''
建立負載與行程|Build load and travel requirements|移動質量包含負載、平台與随動電纜，不只是工件重量。|Moving mass includes payload, carriage and moving cables, not the workpiece alone.|將各質量分項加總，用 ±10% 質量變化測試推力需求。|Sum mass components and test force demand under ±10% total mass variation.
區分峰值與連續力|Separate peak and continuous force|峰值決定短時加速，連續力受線圈與散熱限制。|Peak force supports brief acceleration; continuous force is thermally bounded.|把負載周期轉成力—時間圖，分別取峰值和 RMS。|Convert the duty cycle to a force-time trace and calculate peak and RMS separately.
控制速度與加加速度|Control velocity and jerk|加速度決定慣性力，加加速度影響結構激振和追蹤。|Acceleration sets inertial force; jerk affects structural excitation and tracking.|比較梯形速度與 S 曲線，在相同行程下記錄峰值力及整定時間。|Compare trapezoidal and S-curve motion over equal travel, recording peak force and settling time.
建立力常數|Establish force constants|F=KfI 的電流定義須與廠商峰值或 RMS 慣例一致。|Current convention in F=KfI must match the supplier’s peak/RMS definition.|Kf=20 N/A、F=60 N 時算 3 A，標明所用定義。|For Kf=20 N/A and F=60 N obtain 3 A and state the convention.
核算反電勢|Audit back-EMF|直線速度增加反電勢，驅動器電壓需同時克服電阻與電感。|Linear speed raises back-EMF; the drive voltage must also cover resistance and inductance.|以 v電=Ri+Ldi/dt+Ke·速度 分列高速與快速加速的需求。|Separate high-speed and rapid-acceleration demands using v=Ri+Ldi/dt+Ke·velocity.
評估溫度降額|Assess thermal derating|連續力額定依散熱與環境溫度，安裝板改變熱路。|Continuous-force rating depends on cooling/ambient; mounting plates alter thermal paths.|同功率損耗比較兩個熱阻，確認較高環境下剩餘溫升預算。|Compare two thermal resistances at equal loss and the remaining rise budget at higher ambient.
定位尺與阿貝偏移|Locate scales and Abbe offsets|量測軸偏離工作點時，角誤差會轉為位置誤差。|An offset between measurement axis and work point converts angular error into position error.|h=50 mm、角誤差 100 μrad 時算近似誤差 hθ=5 μm。|For h=50 mm and angular error 100 μrad estimate hθ=5 μm.
辨識解析度與精度|Distinguish resolution and accuracy|更細顯示位元不會消除尺誤差、熱膨脹或機械變形。|Finer digital counts do not remove scale error, thermal expansion or deformation.|將 1 nm 解析度與 1 μm 假設系統誤差分欄，避免等號。|List 1 nm resolution and an assumed 1 μm system error separately rather than equate them.
建立雙迴路控制|Build cascaded control|電流環、速度環和位置環需合適頻寬分離，結構共振限制外環。|Current, speed and position loops need bandwidth separation; structural resonance limits outer loops.|對比提高位置增益前後的共振峰與整定時間。|Compare resonance peaks and settling times before/after increasing position gain.
處理摩擦與齒槽力|Handle friction and cogging|導軌摩擦與磁槽力有不同速度、位置依賴，補償不應混用。|Guide friction and cogging have different speed/position dependencies and need different compensation.|將低速往返误差按位置和方向分組，辨識兩種機制。|Group low-speed bidirectional errors by position and direction to distinguish mechanisms.
評估熱漂移|Assess thermal drift|尺度熱膨脹按 αLΔT 變化，即使控制誤差為零仍會漂移。|Scale expansion follows αLΔT; physical position can drift even with zero control error.|α=10 ppm/K、L=0.5 m、ΔT=5 K 時計算 25 μm。|For α=10 ppm/K, L=0.5 m and ΔT=5 K compute 25 μm.
交付定位誤差預算|Deliver positioning error budgets|重複性、準確度和整定必須在負載、行程及環境定義下報告。|Repeatability, accuracy and settling need defined load, travel and environment.|製作雙向定位誤差圖，分開隨機散布、系統偏差和熱漂移。|Create a bidirectional positioning plot separating random scatter, systematic bias and thermal drift.
''')

C(255,'六步換相、反電勢偵測與電流控制','six-step commutation, back-EMF sensing and current regulation',
'電機與橋臂|換相與感測|啟動與調速|故障與驗證','Motor and bridge|Commutation and sensing|Startup and speed|Faults and validation',
'bldc motorcontrol observers','a258 a267','motor',
'教學例：四極對馬達轉速 3,000 rpm，電頻率 fe=pn/60=200 Hz。一電週六個換相區間，因此換相事件率 1,200 次/s，每區約 0.833 ms。PWM 頻率與換相頻率是不同變數。',
'Teaching example: four pole pairs at 3,000 rpm give fe=pn/60=200 Hz. Six sectors per electrical cycle imply 1,200 commutations/s and about 0.833 ms per sector. PWM frequency and commutation frequency are different variables.',
'電路操作限於模擬；六步控制不適合用作所有 PMSM 的通用性能保證，電機波形與熱限制須匹配。','Circuit work is simulation-only; six-step control is not a universal performance guarantee for all PMSMs, and waveform/thermal compatibility must be checked.',r'''
辨識梯形反電勢|Identify trapezoidal back-EMF|BLDC 名稱常對應梯形反電勢配六步電流，但實際波形可能不理想。|BLDC often pairs trapezoidal EMF with six-step current, but real waveforms can deviate.|將理想梯形與供應商公開波形對照，標出圓角和諧波。|Compare ideal trapezoidal and published waveforms and mark rounded edges/harmonics.
畫出三相橋臂|Draw three-phase bridges|每一相由上、下開關連到 DC 兩端，避免同臂同時導通是基本約束。|Each phase has high/low switches to the DC rails; preventing simultaneous conduction is fundamental.|用離線真值表剔除同臂雙導通組合，不產生實機控制信號。|Eliminate same-leg simultaneous-on combinations in an offline truth table without generating hardware signals.
建立電機電角度|Establish electrical angle|機械圈數與電週數相差極對數，霍爾區間需以電角度理解。|Mechanical turns and electrical cycles differ by pole pairs; Hall sectors use electrical angle.|重算本課 200 Hz 與 0.833 ms，檢查與 PWM 周期不同。|Recompute 200 Hz and 0.833 ms and distinguish them from PWM periods.
配置六步序列|Configure six-step sequences|每區段兩相承載、另一相浮接或受特定調變，序列決定轉矩方向。|Two phases conduct per sector while the third is unpowered or modulated; sequence sets torque direction.|在六區狀態圖追蹤正反轉序列，保持電流方向定義一致。|Trace forward/reverse orders on a six-sector diagram with consistent current signs.
解讀霍爾編碼|Interpret Hall codes|霍爾排列、相序和安裝偏移需匹配，三位元碼不是通用接線標準。|Hall arrangement, phase order and mounting offset must match; 3-bit codes are not universal wiring standards.|用給定合法碼表注入非法 000/111，分類為感測异常而非正常扇區。|Inject invalid 000/111 into a defined valid-code table and classify them as sensing faults.
偵測反電勢過零|Detect back-EMF crossings|浮相反電勢過零與換相時點有電角度關係，濾波會引入延遲。|Floating-phase EMF crossing relates to commutation angle, while filtering adds delay.|在合成反電勢加入 PWM 紋波，比較未濾波與延遲濾波的過零時刻。|Add PWM ripple to synthetic EMF and compare raw and delayed-filter crossing times.
處理零速啟動|Handle zero-speed startup|零速反電勢近零，純反電勢估測無法直接提供可靠初始角。|Back-EMF approaches zero at standstill, so EMF-only sensing cannot reliably give initial angle.|在離線模型比較已知霍爾角和無角資訊兩種初始條件。|Compare known-Hall and unknown-angle initial conditions in an offline model.
配置電流限制|Configure current limits|速度控制命令必須經電流限制，堵轉時低反電勢可使電流快速上升。|Speed commands need current limits; low back-EMF at stall permits rapid current rise.|固定電壓下以 Ri+Ldi/dt 模型比較正常轉速與堵轉。|Use Ri+Ldi/dt at fixed voltage to compare normal rotation and stall.
辨識占空比與速度|Distinguish duty and speed|占空比影響平均電壓，實際速度仍由負載、電阻及反電勢共同決定。|Duty affects average voltage; speed also depends on load, resistance and EMF.|同占空比分別施加兩種負載，記錄穩態轉速差。|Apply two loads at identical duty and record the steady-speed difference.
分析換相轉矩凹陷|Analyze commutation torque dips|電流由一相轉到另一相需要時間，換相區可有轉矩缺口。|Current transfer between phases takes time and can create torque dips.|疊合三相電流與轉矩，確認凹陷是否對齊換相時刻。|Overlay phase currents and torque and check whether dips align with commutation.
檢查失步與感測異常|Check loss of synchronism and sensing faults|過零遺失、霍爾抖動及負載突變可能產生相似速度跌落。|Missed crossings, Hall chatter and load steps can produce similar speed drops.|對三種合成故障比較電流、換相時戳和速度，找出辨識線索。|Compare current, commutation timestamps and speed for three synthetic faults and identify discriminating evidence.
交付全工況測試矩陣|Deliver operating-case matrices|空載順轉不代表帶載啟動、反轉與熱態運作穩定。|No-load forward rotation does not establish loaded startup, reversal or hot operation.|以離線矩陣覆蓋低高轉速、負載及溫度，標出未有證據格。|Cover low/high speed, load and temperature in an offline matrix and flag cells lacking evidence.
''')

C(256,'編碼器尺度、角度校準、同步取樣與錯誤診斷','encoder scaling, angle calibration, synchronous sampling and diagnostics',
'碼尺與介面|尺度與校準|同步與控制|誤差與驗證','Scales and interfaces|Scaling and calibration|Synchronization and control|Errors and validation',
'encoder encoderfaq observers','a254 a257','motor',
'教學例：增量編碼器每圈 2,500 線，以四倍計數得到 10,000 counts/rev，機械解析度 0.036°。四極對馬達的電角解析度是 0.144°，而非 0.036°；解析度不代表絕對精度。',
'Teaching example: a 2,500-line incremental encoder with quadrature x4 yields 10,000 counts/rev and 0.036° mechanical resolution. A four-pole-pair motor has 0.144° electrical resolution, not 0.036°. Resolution is not absolute accuracy.',
'不同編碼器的線數、位元、更新率與協定定義不同；須核對資料表及時間語義，不保證任意接口可互換。','Line count, bits, update rates and protocol definitions vary; verify datasheets and timing semantics rather than assume interchangeable interfaces.',r'''
比較增量與絕對位置|Compare incremental and absolute position|增量介面記錄位移，絕對介面提供編碼位置，斷電後行為不同。|Incremental interfaces track motion; absolute interfaces encode position, with different power-loss behavior.|讓離線計數器失電後重啟，對照是否仍知道軸位置。|Power-cycle an offline counter and compare whether shaft position remains known.
解讀 A/B 相位|Interpret A/B phase|正交 A/B 的先後決定方向，四倍解碼利用雙邊沿。|A/B quadrature ordering determines direction; x4 decoding uses both edges.|手算一圈 2,500 線的 10,000 計數，標出方向反轉時的序列。|Calculate 10,000 counts for 2,500 lines and mark the reversed edge sequence.
建立串列協定欄位|Build serial protocol fields|位置位元、狀態、CRC 與時序字段有不同功能。|Position bits, status, CRC and timing fields serve distinct roles.|分解一個合成封包，刻意改一位並檢查錯誤偵測結果。|Decompose a synthetic packet, flip one bit and check error detection.
統一角度尺度|Unify angle scales|電角度需乘極對數並處理 2π 取餘，不能直接用機械角。|Electrical angle multiplies mechanical angle by pole pairs and wraps modulo 2π.|用本課 0.036° 與 0.144° 例驗證尺度，測試跨圈邊界。|Verify scaling with 0.036° and 0.144° and test wrap boundaries.
標定零位偏移|Calibrate zero offset|編碼器機械零位不一定對齊轉子磁 d 軸。|Encoder mechanical zero need not align with the magnetic d axis.|在模擬中加入固定 10° 電角偏移，觀察 dq 電流串擾。|Add a fixed 10° electrical offset in simulation and observe dq cross-coupling.
處理多圈與回捲|Handle multiturn and rollover|計數回捲應以模數差運算處理，不可當巨大反向位移。|Counter rollover needs modular differencing rather than a huge reverse displacement.|對 16 位計數器 65,534→2 算正向 4 counts，而非負 65,532。|For a 16-bit counter transition 65,534→2 compute +4 counts, not −65,532.
估算取樣延遲|Estimate sampling delay|延遲造成角誤差 Δθ=ωΔt，高速下即使高解析度仍可能不準。|Delay gives angle error Δθ=ωΔt; high resolution does not prevent high-speed error.|3,000 rpm、100 μs 延遲算 1.8° 機械角；四極對變 7.2° 電角。|At 3,000 rpm and 100 μs delay compute 1.8° mechanical and 7.2° electrical for four pole pairs.
同步電流與角度|Synchronize current and angle|Park 變換若使用不同時刻的電流和角度，會產生轉矩誤差。|Park transforms using current and angle from different times create torque errors.|將兩通道時戳對齊前後比較 Id 偏移，保留延遲補償假設。|Compare Id bias before/after timestamp alignment and retain delay-compensation assumptions.
估測速度與量化|Estimate speed and quantization|固定窗口差分低速時只見少數 counts，速度估測會跳動。|Fixed-window differencing sees few counts at low speed, causing speed quantization.|比較 1 ms 與 10 ms 窗口的量化和延遲，勿只選更平滑者。|Compare quantization and delay for 1 ms and 10 ms windows rather than choose smoothness alone.
辨識內插誤差|Identify interpolation errors|正弦餘弦幅值、偏移和相位不平衡可形成週期位置誤差。|Sine/cosine amplitude, offset and phase mismatch create cyclic position error.|在 Lissajous 圖加入偏移，對照角度誤差周期。|Add offset to a Lissajous plot and compare the resulting angular-error period.
判讀解析度與抖動|Interpret resolution and jitter|靜止抖動的 RMS 需標示頻寬，不能與最小計數直接等同。|Stationary RMS jitter needs stated bandwidth and is not the same as minimum count size.|對同一噪聲資料使用兩種頻寬，報告抖動值及濾波延遲。|Apply two bandwidths to one noise record and report both jitter and filter delay.
交付故障可觀測表|Deliver fault-observability tables|CRC 正確仍可能有機械鬆動、比例錯誤或老舊資料。|Correct CRC does not exclude mechanical slip, scaling errors or stale data.|為每類故障指定獨立證據：時戳、電頻率、參考位置或冗餘感測。|Assign independent evidence—timestamp, electrical frequency, reference position or redundant sensing—to each fault.
''')

C(257,'Clarke/Park 變換、dq 電流迴路與電壓限制','Clarke/Park transforms, dq current loops and voltage limits',
'座標與尺度|電流與轉矩|調變與限制|動態與驗證','Coordinates and scaling|Current and torque|Modulation and limits|Dynamics and validation',
'motorcontrol observers foc','a256 a258','motor',
'教學例：採幅值不變 Park 變換，三相平衡電流峰值 10 A，對齊旋轉座標後 d/q 向量幅值仍 10 A。電功率是 1.5(VdId+VqIq)；若 Vq=100 V、Iq=10 A、Vd=Id=0，P=1.5 kW。',
'Teaching example with amplitude-invariant Park scaling: balanced three-phase current of 10 A peak gives a 10 A dq-vector magnitude in an aligned frame. Power is 1.5(VdId+VqIq); Vq=100 V, Iq=10 A and Vd=Id=0 give 1.5 kW.',
'必須固定幅值/功率不變尺度、峰值/RMS 和角度正方向；不同慣例不能混搭控制器參數。','Fix amplitude/power-invariant scaling, peak/RMS convention and angle direction; do not mix controller parameters across conventions.',r'''
檢查三相零和|Check three-phase zero sum|無中性線平衡三相模型可由兩相重建第三相，但偏移會破壞零和。|A balanced three-wire model reconstructs the third phase from two, but offsets break the zero sum.|注入一相 +0.2 A 偏移，查看 Ia+Ib+Ic 殘差。|Inject +0.2 A bias into one phase and inspect the Ia+Ib+Ic residual.
套用 Clarke 變換|Apply Clarke transforms|αβ 將三相映到靜止兩軸，縮放選擇改變幅值與功率係數。|Clarke maps phases to stationary axes; scaling changes amplitudes and power coefficients.|對一組已知三相正弦逐點換算，驗證旋轉向量半徑。|Transform known three-phase sinusoids sample by sample and verify rotating-vector radius.
套用 Park 變換|Apply Park transforms|dq 隨轉子電角旋轉，可把同步正弦量變成近似 DC。|dq rotates with electrical rotor angle, making synchronous sinusoids nearly DC.|正確角度和加 90° 角度各算一次，檢查 d/q 交換與符號。|Calculate with correct and +90° angles and check d/q interchange and signs.
分開磁鏈與轉矩電流|Separate flux and torque current|PMSM 與感應機的 d 軸控制意義不同，不能把所有 Id 都設為零。|The d-axis role differs between PMSM and induction machines; Id is not universally zero.|比較表贴 PMSM 與感應機磁鏈建立需求，記錄模型前提。|Compare surface-PM and induction-machine flux requirements and state assumptions.
建立 dq 電流環|Build dq current loops|R、L 及交叉耦合項決定電流動態，參數誤差影響補償。|R, L and cross-coupling terms set current dynamics; parameter error affects compensation.|以同一階躍比較實際 L 與估計 L 差 20% 的响應。|Compare one current step with actual and estimated inductance differing by 20%.
檢查功率與轉矩一致|Check power/torque consistency|dq 功率係數須與變換尺度一致，否則效率會出現虛假超過 100%。|dq power coefficients must match scaling or computed efficiency may falsely exceed 100%.|重算本課 1.5 kW，並用三相瞬時功率和交叉驗證。|Recompute 1.5 kW and cross-check with summed instantaneous phase power.
連接逆 Park 與 PWM|Connect inverse Park and PWM|控制器輸出電壓向量需轉回橋臂占空比，調變有母線限制。|The commanded voltage vector must map to leg duties within DC-bus limits.|用同一向量比較未限幅和限幅占空比，禁止超出 0–1 的假結果。|Compare unlimited/limited duties for one vector and reject values outside 0–1.
分析採樣與計算延遲|Analyze sampling and computation delay|控制延遲降低相位裕度，迴路頻寬不能無限提高。|Control delay reduces phase margin; bandwidth cannot increase without bound.|固定控制器，將延遲由 1 增至 2 個週期，對照振盪與超越。|Hold the controller fixed, increase delay from one to two cycles and compare oscillation/overshoot.
加入限流與反飽和|Add current limits and anti-windup|電流圓與電壓限制可能同時作用，積分器需反映實際可用致動量。|Current circles and voltage limits can act together; integrators must reflect available actuation.|在速度階躍中記錄指令與實際電壓，檢查解除飽和後的恢復。|Record commanded/actual voltage in a speed step and inspect recovery after saturation clears.
建立弱磁區|Build field-weakening regions|高轉速需在電壓橢圓和電流圓交集中分配 Id/Iq。|High-speed operation allocates Id/Iq within voltage-ellipse/current-circle intersections.|繪出兩個速度的可行區，觀察高速轉矩餘裕縮小。|Plot feasible regions for two speeds and observe shrinking high-speed torque margin.
評估 MTPA 假設|Assess MTPA assumptions|內埋 PMSM 的磁阻轉矩使最佳電流角依參數與飽和改變。|IPM reluctance torque makes the optimal current angle depend on parameters and saturation.|在固定電流幅值掃角，比較含凸極性與 Ld=Lq 的模型。|Sweep angle at fixed current magnitude and compare salient and Ld=Lq models.
交付閉環證據|Deliver closed-loop evidence|穩態低誤差不證明負載階躍、角度誤差和限壓下穩定。|Low steady error does not establish stability under load steps, angle error and voltage limits.|回放三種擾動，記錄電流、速度、功率守恆和相位假設。|Replay three disturbances and record current, speed, energy consistency and angle assumptions.
''')

C(258,'反電勢觀測器、低速可觀測性與估測融合','back-EMF observers, low-speed observability and estimator fusion',
'模型與可觀測性|觀測與濾波|啟動與切換|誤差與驗證','Models and observability|Observers and filtering|Startup and transition|Errors and validation',
'observers foc motorcontrol','a257 a255','motor',
'教學例：用 e=v−Ri−Ldi/dt 估反電勢，若真 e=1 V、電阻誤差 ΔR=0.05 Ω、電流 10 A，僅電阻誤差就造成 0.5 V 偏差。高速 e=20 V 時同偏差只占 2.5%，顯示低速更難。',
'Teaching example: estimate e=v−Ri−Ldi/dt. If true e=1 V, resistance error ΔR=0.05 Ω at 10 A introduces 0.5 V bias. At high-speed e=20 V the same bias is only 2.5%, illustrating the low-speed difficulty.',
'估測器適用性依電機、速度、飽和與訊號品質而異；未配置真實參考量測時不宣稱實機角度精度。','Estimator suitability depends on motor, speed, saturation and signals; do not claim real-machine angle accuracy without reference measurements.',r'''
建立電壓模型|Build voltage models|估反電勢需要實際施加電壓，不只是控制器理想電壓命令。|Back-EMF estimation needs applied voltage, not merely ideal voltage commands.|將 DC 電壓變動與占空比限制加入 v 模型，對比理想命令。|Add bus-voltage variation and duty limits to the voltage model and compare with ideal commands.
分析低速訊噪比|Analyze low-speed SNR|反電勢隨速度下降，偏移與量化誤差相對變大。|Back-EMF falls with speed, increasing relative offset/quantization error.|用本課 1 V 與 20 V 例比較 0.5 V 模型偏差比例。|Compare a 0.5 V model bias against the example’s 1 V and 20 V EMFs.
辨识電阻溫漂|Identify resistance temperature drift|繞組升溫改變 R，固定室溫參數可造成角度與磁鏈誤差。|Winding heating changes R; fixed room-temperature parameters bias angle/flux estimates.|將銅電阻近似 R=R₀[1+αΔT] 加入模型，標明 α 與溫度範圍。|Add approximate copper R=R₀[1+αΔT], stating α and temperature range.
建構反電勢觀測器|Construct EMF observers|觀測器利用模型與量測殘差修正狀態，其收斂不是自動保證。|Observers correct state using model/measurement residuals; convergence is not automatic.|對同一速度起始誤差比較兩種增益的收斂和噪聲。|Compare convergence and noise at two gains for the same initial speed error.
解讀滑動模式抖振|Interpret sliding-mode chattering|高切換增益可增强魯棒性，卻放大抖振和後續濾波需求。|High switching gain can improve robustness but increases chattering and filtering demands.|掃描增益，記錄角度 RMS 誤差及高頻殘差，不只看收斂時間。|Sweep gain and record angle RMS error/high-frequency residuals, not just convergence time.
補償濾波相位|Compensate filter phase|低通去噪會延遲反電勢角，延遲補償須隨頻率評估。|Low-pass denoising delays EMF angle; compensation must be assessed versus frequency.|對一階濾波相位 −atan(ωτ) 比較低高電頻率。|Compare first-order filter phase −atan(ωτ) at low/high electrical frequencies.
處理零速不可觀測|Handle standstill observability|無反電勢時，純電壓模型不能可靠區分轉子初始角。|Without EMF, a pure voltage model cannot reliably distinguish initial rotor angle.|以多個初始角產生相同零速輸出，展示估測資訊不足。|Generate identical standstill outputs for multiple initial angles to demonstrate insufficient information.
比較高頻注入原理|Compare high-frequency injection|凸極性可提供低速位置資訊，但飽和、噪音和電機結構限制適用。|Saliency can provide low-speed angle information, bounded by saturation, acoustics and construction.|比較 Ld≠Lq 與 Ld=Lq 的合成響應，不聲稱所有電機都可用。|Compare synthetic responses for Ld≠Lq and Ld=Lq without claiming universal applicability.
設計觀測器切換|Design estimator transitions|低速方法與反電勢法切換需角度連續與可信度判據。|Transitioning between low-speed and EMF methods needs angle continuity and confidence criteria.|在重疊轉速區混合角度時使用圓周處理，避免 359° 與 1° 平均成 180°。|Blend angles circularly in the overlap region; avoid averaging 359° and 1° to 180°.
驗證速度反轉|Validate speed reversal|過零轉速時反電勢符號與可觀測性同時改變，是重要挑戰。|At zero-speed reversal both EMF sign and observability change, creating a critical case.|回放正轉—零速—反轉序列，標出失鎖、恢復與不確定區。|Replay forward/zero/reverse speed and mark loss of lock, recovery and uncertain regions.
分離參數與感測故障|Separate parameter/sensor faults|模型 R/L 錯誤和電流偏移可產生相似觀測殘差。|R/L model errors and current offsets can create similar observer residuals.|分別注入兩種誤差，用不同速度與負載的殘差特性區分。|Inject each error and distinguish them using residual behavior across speed and load.
交付有參考角的誤差圖|Deliver referenced angle-error maps|估測值彼此一致不等於真實，需要獨立角度參考。|Agreement among estimates is not truth; an independent angle reference is required.|用合成真值畫速度×負載角誤差圖，明確標示模擬真值而非實測。|Use synthetic ground truth for a speed/load angle-error map and label it simulated, not measured.
''')

C(259,'機械動能、回生轉矩與儲能接受能力','kinetic energy, regenerative torque and storage acceptance',
'動能與負載|轉矩與逆變|電池與母線|協調與驗證','Kinetic energy and load|Torque and inversion|Battery and bus|Coordination and validation',
'motorcontrol storage traction','a244 a261','motor',
'教學例：1,500 kg 車輛由 20 m/s 降至 10 m/s，動能差 0.5m(v₁²−v₂²)=225 kJ=62.5 Wh；若機電回收效率 70%，最多回收 43.75 Wh，尚需扣除其他限制造成的損失。',
'Teaching example: a 1,500 kg vehicle slowing from 20 to 10 m/s loses 0.5m(v₁²−v₂²)=225 kJ=62.5 Wh. At 70% recovery efficiency, at most 43.75 Wh is recovered before other limits.',
'這是離線功率與控制課，不是道路車輛煞車改裝指南；制動安全與功能安全需獨立專業驗證。','This is offline power/control education, not a road-vehicle braking modification guide; braking and functional safety need independent professional validation.',r'''
核算平移動能|Audit translational energy|可回收能量由速度平方差決定，不是速度差本身。|Recoverable kinetic energy follows the difference of squared speeds, not speed difference alone.|重算本課 62.5 Wh，再比較由 10 m/s 降至零的 20.83 Wh。|Recompute 62.5 Wh and compare with 20.83 Wh for slowing from 10 m/s to zero.
加入旋轉慣量|Add rotational inertia|車輪與傳動旋轉動能也是能量帳一部分，等效質量需有傳動比依據。|Wheel/drivetrain rotational energy belongs in the ledger; equivalent mass needs gear-ratio justification.|用 ΣJω²/2 對各軸分項，避免把高速軸直接當車輪轉速。|Sum Jω²/2 by shaft rather than assign wheel speed to high-speed shafts.
拆分坡度與阻力|Separate grades and drag|下坡位能、空氣阻力與滾阻改變制動功率，不全可進電池。|Grade energy, aerodynamic drag and rolling resistance change braking power; not all reaches the battery.|在同速度曲線加入重力位能項和阻力耗能，檢查守恆。|Add gravitational potential and drag dissipation to one speed profile and check conservation.
建立四象限轉矩|Build four-quadrant torque|回生時轉矩與轉速符號相反，機械功率為負並流向電端。|In regeneration torque opposes speed, so mechanical power is negative and flows electrically outward.|對四個 T/ω 符號組合分類電動與發電。|Classify all four torque/speed sign combinations as motoring or generating.
檢查逆變器限流|Check inverter current limits|回生轉矩受電流、電壓和轉速共同限制。|Regenerative torque is jointly limited by current, voltage and speed.|在轉矩—轉速圖疊合回生限流與高速限壓區。|Overlay regenerative current and high-speed voltage limits on torque-speed maps.
核算直流母線能量|Audit DC-bus energy|負載或電池不能接受能量時，回生會推高 DC 電壓。|When the load/battery cannot absorb energy, regeneration raises DC voltage.|用 ΔE=CΔ(V²)/2 估母線可吸收能量，與一次制動能量比較。|Use ΔE=CΔ(V²)/2 for bus absorption and compare it with one braking event.
建構充電接受包絡|Build charge-acceptance envelopes|高 SOC、低溫和老化都可降低電池容許充電功率。|High SOC, low temperature and aging can reduce acceptable charge power.|對三種假設 BMS 限值裁切回生功率序列，計算餘能。|Clip one regenerative profile with three hypothetical BMS limits and calculate excess energy.
分配混合儲能|Allocate hybrid storage|超級電容可承接短峰值，仍需在後續時段釋放能量。|Supercapacitors can take short peaks but must discharge that energy later.|連續重複制動事件，檢查電容是否逐次充滿而失去緩衝。|Repeat braking events and check whether capacitor filling gradually removes buffer capacity.
協調摩擦制動|Coordinate friction braking|電回收不足時，總制動需求仍需由獨立機械制動滿足。|When regeneration is insufficient, independent friction braking must still meet total demand.|以離線需求分配圖保持總減速度，讓回生上限變動。|Maintain total deceleration in an offline allocation diagram while varying regeneration limits.
計算效率乘積|Calculate efficiency chains|電機、逆變器、DC/DC 和電池充電效率各自降低回收能量。|Motor, inverter, DC/DC and battery charging efficiencies each reduce recovery.|將 0.9×0.96×0.95 算 82.08%，避免把效率相加。|Multiply 0.9×0.96×0.95 for 82.08%, rather than add efficiencies.
辨識低速回收下降|Identify low-speed recovery limits|低速下反電勢和可回收功率下降，恆定回收百分比會失真。|At low speed back-EMF and recoverable power fall; constant recovery fractions become misleading.|對相同制動轉矩畫 P=Tω 趨零，與電池功率限制分開。|Plot P=Tω approaching zero at equal braking torque and distinguish battery-power constraints.
交付駕駛週期能量帳|Deliver drive-cycle energy ledgers|單次回生峰值不等於整段路線節能，需累計完整週期。|Peak regeneration is not route energy savings; integrate the complete cycle.|分列牽引、回收、摩擦、阻力及輔機能量，驗證總和。|Separate traction, recovery, friction, drag and auxiliary energies and reconcile the total.
''')

C(260,'磁浮位置回授、負剛性、轉子模態與停機能量','magnetic-bearing feedback, negative stiffness, rotor modes and rundown energy',
'磁力與氣隙|感測與控制|轉子與模態|失效與驗證','Force and gaps|Sensing and control|Rotor and modes|Failures and validation',
'magnetic magneticmotor flywheel','a245 a256','motor',
'教學例：簡化吸力 F≈kI²/g²，若電流固定而氣隙由 1.0 降至 0.8 mm，吸力增至 1/0.8²=1.5625 倍。轉子越靠近磁極吸力越強，顯示需主動穩定；此式忽略飽和和漏磁。',
'Teaching example: approximate attraction F≈kI²/g². At fixed current reducing gap from 1.0 to 0.8 mm raises force by 1/0.8²=1.5625. Attraction grows as the rotor approaches a pole, requiring active stabilization; saturation and leakage are omitted.',
'磁浮軸承屬高速轉子安全關鍵系統；只分析公開概念及合成數據，不指導超速、拆卸或實機增益調整。','Magnetic bearings are safety-critical high-speed rotor systems; only public concepts and synthetic data are analyzed, without overspeed, disassembly or live tuning instructions.',r'''
分辨徑向與軸向支承|Separate radial and axial support|轉子平移與傾轉自由度需不同位置的致動和感測。|Rotor translation and tilt require spatially distinct actuation and sensing.|畫出兩個徑向軸承及一個軸向控制概念，數清受控自由度。|Sketch two radial bearing stations and one axial control concept and count controlled degrees of freedom.
分析吸力非線性|Analyze nonlinear attraction|磁力對電流與氣隙非線性，偏置點附近才可線性化。|Force is nonlinear in current and gap and can be linearized only near a bias point.|用本課氣隙比重算 1.5625 倍，與線性近似比較誤差。|Recompute the 1.5625 gap-ratio result and compare linearization error.
辨識開迴路不穩定|Identify open-loop instability|位移靠近一側會增加該側吸力，形成需控制抵消的負剛性。|Motion toward one pole increases attraction, creating negative stiffness needing feedback.|在簡化方塊圖給小擾動，觀察無回授時偏移擴大。|Apply a small disturbance to a simplified block model and observe drift without feedback.
配置位移感測|Configure displacement sensing|感測器量到的是其位置附近表面，幾何跳動可混入真實運動。|Sensors see the nearby rotor surface; geometric runout can mix with true motion.|比較轉子靜態跳動表與運轉位移頻譜，提出補償界線。|Compare static runout maps and operating displacement spectra and define compensation bounds.
建立電流內環|Build inner current loops|線圈電感限制電流變化率，功率放大器電壓也決定力頻寬。|Coil inductance and amplifier voltage bound current slew and force bandwidth.|用 di/dt≈V/L 比較兩種線圈電感，保持放大器電壓相同。|Compare di/dt≈V/L for two inductances at equal amplifier voltage.
建立位置外環|Build outer position loops|位置控制需穩定負剛性並留相位裕度，增益越大不必然越好。|Position control must stabilize negative stiffness with phase margin; higher gain is not always better.|在離線模型掃增益與延遲，記錄穩定邊界和電流峰值。|Sweep gain/delay offline and record stability boundaries and peak current.
讀取 Campbell 圖|Read Campbell diagrams|轉速相關模態與激振交會會形成臨界轉速風險。|Intersections of speed-dependent modes and excitation can identify critical-speed risk.|在示意 Campbell 圖標出 1× 轉速線與模態交點。|Mark intersections between 1× speed excitation and modes on an illustrative Campbell diagram.
區分同步與非同步振動|Separate synchronous and asynchronous motion|不平衡常隨 1× 轉速，其他失穩可能不鎖定同一倍頻。|Imbalance often tracks 1× speed; other instabilities may be asynchronous.|用轉速掃描頻譜追蹤峰值是否保持 1×，避免只看單點 FFT。|Track peaks through a speed sweep to test 1× locking rather than inspect one FFT.
限制控制飽和|Limit control saturation|力或電流飽和會使原線性穩定分析失效。|Force/current saturation invalidates the original linear stability analysis.|在相同擾動下比較有無限幅模型，記錄碰到氣隙邊界的時刻。|Compare limited/unlimited models under one disturbance and record gap-boundary crossings.
分析備援支承|Analyze backup support|觸地軸承與停機能量管理處理失去磁浮時的機械後果。|Touchdown bearings and rundown-energy management address mechanical consequences of lost levitation.|建立概念失效樹，把控制電源、位置感測和支承能力分開。|Build a conceptual fault tree separating control power, sensing and backup support capacity.
核算停機能量|Audit rundown energy|主電源切離後仍有 Jω²/2 機械能，不能立即視為靜止安全狀態。|After main-power removal Jω²/2 remains; the rotor cannot immediately be treated as stationary.|用慣量和轉速算殘餘能量，依假設損耗畫離線衰減曲線。|Calculate residual energy from inertia/speed and plot offline decay under assumed losses.
交付穩定性證據|Deliver stability evidence|性能須涵蓋轉速、溫度、偏置和感測誤差的範圍。|Evidence must cover speed, temperature, bias and sensing-error ranges.|製作工況矩陣，對每格記錄位移、電流、阻尼與尚未驗證模態。|Build a case matrix recording displacement, current, damping and unvalidated modes.
''')

C(261,'SiC 開關暫態、牽引效率與電熱限制','SiC switching transients, traction efficiency and electrothermal limits',
'牽引與器件|門極與母線|損耗與冷卻|控制與驗證','Traction and devices|Gates and bus|Losses and cooling|Control and validation',
'traction sicdriver gate','a252 a259','power',
'教學例：假設一次開關 Eon+Eoff=2 mJ、fs=20 kHz，單顆近似開關損耗 40 W。若導通 RMS 電流 100 A、等效 Rds(on)=5 mΩ，導通損耗 50 W；R 值必須對應工作溫度，開關能量也須對應電壓電流條件。',
'Teaching example: assumed Eon+Eoff=2 mJ at fs=20 kHz gives about 40 W switching loss per device. At 100 A RMS and effective Rds(on)=5 mΩ, conduction loss is 50 W. Resistance must match operating temperature and switching energy must match voltage/current conditions.',
'電動車高壓牽引系統需絕緣、功能安全與專業試驗；本課只操作合成波形和模型，不提供實機高壓接線。','High-voltage traction requires insulation, functional safety and professional tests; this course uses synthetic traces/models without physical high-voltage wiring instructions.',r'''
界定牽引工作區|Bound traction operation|峰值功率、持續轉矩與回生能力須分開指定。|Peak power, continuous torque and regeneration must be specified separately.|建立轉矩—轉速圖，加入電池電壓上下限兩種情境。|Build torque-speed maps for low/high battery voltage.
比較 Si 與 SiC 特性|Compare Si and SiC behavior|材料差異可改善開關和溫度特性，但系統收益取決於拓樸與工況。|Material differences can improve switching/thermal behavior, but system benefit depends on topology and duty.|用相同電壓電流條件比較資料表，不把典型峰值當全域保證。|Compare datasheets under matched voltage/current conditions rather than generalize a typical peak.
核對額定與降額|Check ratings and derating|阻斷電壓額定不等於允許所有開關過衝，溫度與壽命需餘裕。|Blocking rating does not permit arbitrary overshoot; temperature/life need margin.|把 DC 最大值、寄生過衝及不確定度分欄，標出待驗證設計裕度。|Separate maximum DC voltage, parasitic overshoot and uncertainty, marking margin for validation.
分析寄生電感過衝|Analyze parasitic overshoot|V=Ldi/dt 使快速 SiC 邊沿對迴路電感敏感。|V=Ldi/dt makes fast SiC edges sensitive to loop inductance.|L=10 nH、di/dt=5 kA/μs 時估 50 V，明示局部近似。|For 10 nH and 5 kA/μs estimate 50 V and label the local approximation.
比較 Kelvin 源極|Compare Kelvin source connections|功率回流與閘極參考共用電感可形成負回授或誤觸發。|Shared power/gate-reference inductance can create feedback or false turn-on.|畫出含共用源極電感及分離參考的兩種原創回路。|Draw original loops with shared source inductance and separated gate reference.
控制 Miller 電流|Control Miller current|快速漏極電壓變動經 Cgd 形成位移電流，需與關斷路徑阻抗一起判讀。|Fast drain-voltage change drives displacement current through Cgd, interacting with off-state impedance.|以 i=Cgd·dv/dt 比較兩個 dv/dt，追蹤假設閘極電壓峰。|Compare two dv/dt values using i=Cgd·dv/dt and track the assumed gate-voltage peak.
建立損耗地圖|Build loss maps|導通與開關損耗對電流、頻率和溫度的依賴不同。|Conduction and switching losses depend differently on current, frequency and temperature.|重算本課 50 W 與 40 W，再把 fs 加倍比較總損耗。|Recompute 50 W and 40 W, then double fs and compare total loss.
連結熱阻與瞬態|Link thermal resistance/transients|短脈衝需熱阻抗 Zth(t)，長時穩態才適用單一 Rth。|Short pulses need thermal impedance Zth(t); one Rth fits long steady conditions.|用相同峰功率比較 10 ms 和 10 s 脈衝的溫升模型。|Compare temperature rise for 10 ms and 10 s pulses with equal peak power.
評估功率循環|Assess power cycling|結溫擺幅、平均溫度和循環時間共同影響封裝疲勞。|Junction swing, mean temperature and cycle duration jointly affect package fatigue.|對兩條同平均溫度曲線比較 ΔTj，避免只報平均溫度。|Compare ΔTj for traces with equal mean temperature instead of reporting the mean alone.
驗證短路保護時序|Validate short-circuit timing|短路承受能力取決於器件與條件，感測和關斷延遲要整體核算。|Short-circuit withstand is device/condition dependent; sensing and turn-off delays need a total budget.|以合成時序圖加總檢測、隔離和關斷延遲，標示無資料不放行。|Sum detection, isolation and turn-off delays on synthetic timing charts; withhold approval where data is missing.
檢查電磁干擾|Check electromagnetic interference|更快邊沿可降低開關損耗同時增加共模及輻射挑戰。|Faster edges can reduce switching loss while increasing common-mode/radiated challenges.|在同輸出工況比較閘極速度兩檔的損耗與 dv/dt。|At equal output compare loss and dv/dt for two gate-speed cases.
交付驅動週期效率|Deliver drive-cycle efficiency|額定點高效率不等於整個車輛週期最佳，需加權工況。|High rated-point efficiency does not imply optimal drive-cycle performance.|對城市與高速兩種合成轉矩—速度時序積分損耗。|Integrate losses over synthetic urban and highway torque-speed profiles.
''')

C(262,'GaN 寄生、反向導通與高頻量測限制','GaN parasitics, reverse conduction and high-frequency measurement limits',
'器件與拓樸|回路與門極|磁件與熱|量測與驗證','Devices and topology|Loops and gates|Magnetics and heat|Measurement and validation',
'gan ganpfc gate','a263 a266','power',
'教學例：假設寄生迴路 L=5 nH、di/dt=2 A/ns，Ldi/dt 過衝為 10 V。若等效開關能量 20 μJ、頻率 500 kHz，平均開關損耗 10 W；這是教學假設，不是任何 GaN 料號規格。',
'Teaching example: assumed loop L=5 nH and di/dt=2 A/ns produce 10 V overshoot from Ldi/dt. Effective switching energy 20 μJ at 500 kHz yields 10 W average switching loss. These are teaching assumptions, not GaN part specifications.',
'不同 GaN 技術的門極電壓、反向行為和動態電阻不同；不能把矽 MOSFET 或某一 GaN 的設定直接套用。','Gate voltage, reverse behavior and dynamic resistance differ across GaN technologies; do not transfer silicon or one GaN device’s settings blindly.',r'''
辨識 GaN 器件結構|Identify GaN device structures|增强型、疊接或整合驅動器方案有不同外部介面與限制。|Enhancement-mode, cascode and integrated-driver solutions have different interfaces/limits.|依實際資料表分類三種方案，只比較共同定義的參數。|Classify three solutions from their datasheets and compare only consistently defined parameters.
比較 Qg 與 Coss|Compare Qg and Coss|閘極電荷和輸出電容控制不同能量路徑，不可用一者代替全部損耗。|Gate charge and output capacitance govern different energy paths and cannot substitute for all loss terms.|分別畫閘極驅動和功率換流能量帳，標出電壓相依。|Draw separate gate-drive and power-commutation ledgers and mark voltage dependence.
核對閘極容許範圍|Check gate operating limits|GaN 閘極餘裕依器件技術而異，絕對最大值不是建議操作點。|GaN gate margin depends on technology; an absolute maximum is not a recommended setpoint.|對一份公開資料表分欄列建議值、極限值和條件，勿提供通用電壓。|Separate recommended, absolute and conditional values from one public datasheet without prescribing universal voltage.
縮短功率迴路模型|Model compact power loops|高 di/dt 下幾 nH 的電感也會造成可觀過衝。|At high di/dt even a few nH can create substantial overshoot.|重算本課 10 V，再把寄生 L 加倍比較過衝。|Recompute 10 V and double parasitic L to compare overshoot.
處理共源電感|Handle common-source inductance|源極寄生可把功率電流變化耦合到閘極參考。|Source parasitics couple power-current changes into the gate reference.|在等效圖加入共源 L，追蹤閘源實際電壓與驅動命令的差別。|Add common-source L to an equivalent diagram and compare actual Vgs with drive command.
分析反向導通|Analyze reverse conduction|GaN 反向導通不應直接套用矽體二極體恢復模型。|GaN reverse conduction should not inherit a silicon body-diode recovery model uncritically.|比較資料表反向 I–V 與器件結構，再標記死區導通能量。|Compare reverse I–V data and device structure, then identify dead-time conduction energy.
優化死區權衡|Optimize dead-time tradeoffs|過長死區增加反向導通損耗，過短則可能產生交越導通。|Long dead time adds reverse-conduction loss; short dead time risks cross-conduction.|只在模擬中掃死區，記錄損耗與兩開關同時導通的禁區。|Sweep dead time only in simulation, recording loss and forbidden simultaneous-conduction regions.
重新設計磁性元件|Redesign magnetics|高頻減少所需電感或匝數，但集膚、鄰近及磁心損耗可能增加。|Higher frequency reduces required inductance/turns but may increase skin, proximity and core losses.|比較 100 與 500 kHz 同功率設計的磁損分項，不只比較體積。|Compare magnetic-loss components at 100 and 500 kHz for equal power, not size alone.
核算熱密度|Audit thermal density|更小封裝提高局部熱通量，板上散熱路徑可能成為瓶頸。|Smaller packages raise local heat flux, making board thermal paths bottlenecks.|同 10 W 分散在 1 和 0.25 cm²，比較 10 與 40 W/cm²。|Distribute 10 W over 1 and 0.25 cm² and compare 10 and 40 W/cm².
辨識探棒負載|Identify probe loading|探棒電容與接地電感會改變被測快速波形。|Probe capacitance and ground inductance alter the fast waveform being measured.|在合成開關回路加入探棒寄生，比較振鈴頻率和峰值。|Add probe parasitics to a synthetic switching loop and compare ringing frequency/peak.
評估動態導通電阻|Assess dynamic on-resistance|開關歷史與陷阱效應可能使動態 R 比静態值高，需依量測條件判讀。|Switching history and trapping can raise dynamic R above static values; conditions matter.|分開記錄應力電壓、延遲及溫度，禁止把不同條件曲線直接排序。|Record stress voltage, delay and temperature separately and avoid ranking unmatched curves.
交付頻率權衡圖|Deliver frequency tradeoff maps|最佳頻率取決於磁件、開關、EMI 和熱的共同限制。|Best frequency depends jointly on magnetics, switching, EMI and thermal limits.|用三個候選頻率繪製損耗、體積和不確定度，說明選擇依據。|Plot loss, size and uncertainty for three candidate frequencies and justify selection.
''')

C(263,'LLC 雙諧振、增益曲線與軟切換邊界','LLC dual resonances, gain curves and soft-switching bounds',
'諧振與等效|增益與磁件|切換與控制|負載與驗證','Resonance and equivalents|Gain and magnetics|Switching and control|Load and validation',
'llc llcfaq psfbfund','a264 a262','power',
'教學例：Lr=20 μH、Cr=100 nF，串聯諧振 fr=1/(2π√(LrCr))≈112.54 kHz。若 Lm=100 μH，另一理想頻率 1/(2π√((Lr+Lm)Cr))≈45.94 kHz。實際 LLC 增益還依負載、變壓器比及寄生而變。',
'Teaching example: Lr=20 μH and Cr=100 nF give series resonance fr=1/(2π√(LrCr))≈112.54 kHz. With Lm=100 μH, the other ideal frequency is about 45.94 kHz using Lr+Lm. Actual LLC gain also depends on load, turns ratio and parasitics.',
'基波近似用於初步理解，輕載、啟動與大偏離諧振時需時域模型；本課不提供高壓實機調機程序。','Fundamental-harmonic approximation is introductory; light load, startup and operation far from resonance need time-domain models, with no live high-voltage tuning instructions.',r'''
辨識三個儲能元件|Identify three storage elements|Lr、Lm 與 Cr 的作用不同，磁化支路並非可任意刪除。|Lr, Lm and Cr have distinct roles; the magnetizing branch cannot be arbitrarily removed.|在原創等效電路標記兩電感電流及差值對應的負載電流。|Mark both inductor currents and their load-current difference on an original equivalent circuit.
計算兩個特徵頻率|Calculate characteristic frequencies|不同導通區間會呈現不同等效諧振，不能只有一個 LC 頻率。|Different conduction intervals yield different effective resonance; one LC frequency is insufficient.|重算本課 112.54 與 45.94 kHz，檢查 μH/nF 單位。|Recompute 112.54 and 45.94 kHz and check μH/nF units.
建立基波近似|Build fundamental approximation|方波以基波近似會忽略高次諧波和切換细節。|Approximating a square wave by its fundamental omits harmonics and commutation details.|在同一負載比較基波近似和時域波形平均值，標出偏差。|Compare fundamental-model and time-domain averages at one load and mark differences.
正規化增益曲線|Normalize gain curves|增益取決於頻率比、負載品質因數及電感比。|Gain depends on normalized frequency, load quality factor and inductance ratio.|用固定 Lm/Lr 掃兩種負載，觀察增益峰值移動。|At fixed Lm/Lr sweep two loads and observe peak-gain changes.
選擇匝數比邊界|Choose turns-ratio bounds|匝數比需同時滿足最小輸入、最大輸入與輸出範圍。|Turns ratio must accommodate minimum/maximum input and output range together.|對三個工況算所需歸一化增益，確認是否在可行頻帶。|Calculate required normalized gain at three operating points and check the feasible band.
評估磁化電流|Assess magnetizing current|較小 Lm 可提供換流能量，但增加循環電流及導通損耗。|Smaller Lm can support commutation but raises circulating current/conduction loss.|保持功率相同比較 Lm 減半時的磁化電流與 RMS。|At equal output compare magnetizing and RMS currents when Lm is halved.
辨識感性與容性區|Distinguish inductive/capacitive regions|輸入阻抗相位決定換流條件，容性區可能破壞所需 ZVS。|Input-impedance phase determines commutation conditions; capacitive operation can defeat intended ZVS.|在增益圖旁標相位正負，不單凭效率猜測軟切換。|Mark impedance-phase sign beside gain curves instead of inferring soft switching from efficiency alone.
核對 ZVS 能量|Check ZVS energy|可用電感能量需足以轉移開關節點電容，輕載不自動保證。|Available inductive energy must commutate node capacitance; light load is not automatically safe for ZVS.|比較 0.5LI² 與輸出電容能量尺度，說明非線性 Coss 的限制。|Compare 0.5LI² with node-capacitance energy and state nonlinear Coss limitations.
管理同步整流時序|Manage synchronous rectification|次級電流過零與驅動延遲決定反向電流風險。|Secondary zero crossing and drive delay determine reverse-current risk.|在合成次級電流上疊加提前/延遲關斷，積分反向能量。|Overlay early/late turn-off on synthetic secondary current and integrate reverse energy.
設計啟動包絡|Design startup envelopes|尚未建立穩態時的諧振電容和輸出能量不能由增益圖直接推定。|Startup capacitor/output energies are not directly predicted by steady gain curves.|比較兩種離線頻率斜坡，記錄峰值電流及輸出超越。|Compare two offline frequency ramps and record peak current/output overshoot.
處理輕載突發模式|Handle light-load burst behavior|突發降低待機損耗但可能增加可聞噪音和輸出紋波。|Burst control reduces standby loss but may increase acoustic noise/output ripple.|在相同平均負載比較連續和突發波形，報告峰對峰及頻譜。|Compare continuous/burst traces at equal average load and report peak-to-peak ripple/spectrum.
交付容差敏感度|Deliver tolerance sensitivity|Lr、Cr、Lm 與漏感容差會移動增益與 ZVS 邊界。|Lr, Cr, Lm and leakage tolerances shift gain/ZVS boundaries.|以 ±10% 假設元件容差跑角落案例，標出未覆蓋的操作區。|Run corner cases with assumed ±10% component tolerance and mark uncovered operation.
''')

C(264,'移相功率傳遞、續流、占空比損失與 ZVS','phase-shift power transfer, freewheeling, duty loss and ZVS',
'橋臂與相移|磁件與整流|切換與控制|瞬態與驗證','Legs and phase shift|Magnetics and rectification|Switching and control|Transients and validation',
'psfb psfbfund psfbsdk','a263 a265','power',
'教學例：理想輸出近似 Vout≈Vin·(Ns/Np)·Deff。Vin=400 V、Ns/Np=0.1、Deff=0.30 時得 12 V；若換流造成有效占空比降至 0.27，則變 10.8 V，需控制補償但仍受最大相移限制。',
'Teaching example: ideally Vout≈Vin·(Ns/Np)·Deff. With 400 V, Ns/Np=0.1 and Deff=0.30 the output is 12 V. Commutation reducing effective duty to 0.27 gives 10.8 V; control can compensate only within the maximum phase-shift limit.',
'理想 PWM 模型不包含全部漏感、磁通偏移與整流暫態；工程判讀需時域與元件條件交叉驗證。','Ideal PWM models omit leakage, flux bias and rectifier transients; interpretation needs time-domain and component-condition cross-checks.',r'''
描繪兩橋臂相位|Plot bridge-leg phases|兩橋臂各維持近半週開關，以相對相位改變變壓器有效電壓。|Both legs switch near half duty; relative phase changes effective transformer voltage.|畫出兩腿電壓及其差值，區分零電壓續流區與能量傳遞區。|Plot both leg voltages and their difference, separating zero-voltage freewheel and transfer intervals.
定義相移與有效占空|Define phase shift and effective duty|命令相移不等於整流後有效占空比，換流會消耗時間。|Commanded phase shift differs from rectified effective duty because commutation consumes time.|將命令和次級實际脈寬分欄量測，重算 12→10.8 V 例。|Measure commanded and actual secondary widths separately and recompute the 12-to-10.8 V example.
追蹤初級續流|Trace primary freewheeling|零輸出電壓期間初級仍可能有循環電流及導通損耗。|Primary circulating current and conduction loss can persist during zero-output-voltage intervals.|在初級電流圖標出有電流但無有效功率傳遞的區段。|Mark intervals with current but no useful power transfer on primary-current traces.
選擇變壓器匝比|Choose transformer ratios|最大可用占空比、輸入範圍和整流壓降共同決定匝比。|Maximum effective duty, input range and rectifier drops jointly determine ratio.|用最小輸入與最大負載條件檢查剩餘控制裕度。|Check remaining control margin at minimum input and maximum load.
分析漏感換流|Analyze leakage commutation|漏感支持 ZVS 能量但也增加換流時間和占空比損失。|Leakage supports ZVS energy but also increases commutation time/duty loss.|在兩個漏感模型比較輕載 ZVS 與滿載有效占空，記錄權衡。|Compare light-load ZVS and full-load effective duty for two leakage models.
比較次級整流方式|Compare secondary rectification|中心抽頭、全橋和倍流整流有不同器件應力及磁件配置。|Center-tapped, full-bridge and current-doubler rectification have different stresses/magnetics.|在相同輸出需求畫三種概念路徑，列出導通器件數。|Draw three conceptual paths at equal output requirement and count conducting devices.
區分領先與落後橋臂|Distinguish leading/lagging legs|兩橋臂換流時的可用電流與電容不同，ZVS 範圍不必相同。|Available commutation current/capacitance differs between legs, so ZVS ranges can differ.|逐腿檢查電壓是否在開通前已降至近零，不只看單一波形。|Check each leg’s voltage before turn-on rather than inspect just one waveform.
建立峰值電流控制|Build peak-current control|每周期電流比較可快速限制能量，但須考慮斜坡補償與雜訊。|Cycle-by-cycle current comparison limits energy quickly but needs slope/noise treatment.|比較含與不含感測尖峰的合成比較器輸出，避免錯誤提前關斷。|Compare synthetic comparator outputs with/without sensing spikes and identify false early turn-off.
檢查磁通平衡|Check flux balance|正負伏秒不平衡可使磁通偏移，平均輸出正常仍可能飽和。|Unequal positive/negative volt-seconds bias flux even with normal average output.|積分一周期變壓器電壓，注入微小脈寬差觀察累積偏移。|Integrate transformer voltage per cycle and inject small pulse-width asymmetry to observe drift.
限制次級過衝|Limit secondary overshoot|漏感與整流器電容形成振鈴，鉗位損耗需進總帳。|Leakage and rectifier capacitance ring; clamp loss belongs in the total ledger.|由振鈴頻率估 LC 尺度，再比較阻尼前後的峰值及耗能。|Estimate LC scale from ringing frequency and compare peaks/dissipation before and after damping.
驗證負載瞬變|Validate load transients|快電流環不保證輸出電容與外環能满足負載階躍。|A fast current loop does not alone ensure output-capacitor/outer-loop load-step performance.|對相同負載階躍記錄輸出欠壓、電流限幅及恢复時間。|For one load step record output dip, current limiting and recovery time.
交付全範圍效率|Deliver full-range efficiency|循環電流使輕載效率可能下降，單一峰值效率不可代替曲線。|Circulating current can hurt light-load efficiency; one peak does not replace a curve.|建立輸入電壓×負載矩陣，逐格標示 ZVS 狀態與損耗。|Build an input-voltage/load matrix with ZVS state and loss at each point.
''')

C(265,'雙橋相移、漏感功率傳遞與雙向控制','dual-bridge phase shift, leakage-inductance power transfer and bidirectional control',
'拓樸與參考|相移與電流|軟切換與控制|損耗與驗證','Topology and references|Phase shift and current|Soft switching and control|Losses and validation',
'dab dabsdk psfbfund','a243 a264','power',
'教學例：理想單相移 DAB，P=V1·V2′/(ωL)·φ(1−abs(φ)/π)，V2′為折算至一次側的方波幅值，φ 用 rad。V1=V2′=400 V、f=100 kHz、L=20 μH、φ=π/6，P≈5.56 kW；反向 φ 改符號。',
'Teaching example for ideal single-phase-shift DAB: P=V1·V2′/(ωL)·φ(1−abs(φ)/π), with V2′ the secondary square-wave amplitude referred to the primary and φ in radians. At V1=V2′=400 V, f=100 kHz, L=20 μH and φ=π/6, P≈5.56 kW. Reversing φ reverses power.',
'公式假設理想方波、忽略磁化與電阻且採定義一致的單相移；大相移和電壓失配需檢查 RMS 電流及 ZVS 邊界。','The formula assumes ideal square waves, neglected magnetizing/resistive effects and consistent single-phase-shift definitions; large shifts and mismatch require RMS-current/ZVS checks.',r'''
辨識兩側主動橋|Identify both active bridges|DAB 兩側皆可切換，功率方向由相位與控制決定，不靠翻轉接線。|Both DAB bridges switch; phase/control sets power direction without rewiring.|在原創方塊圖標記兩側 DC 電容、橋、變壓器及串聯電感。|Mark DC capacitors, bridges, transformer and series inductance in an original block diagram.
統一變壓器折算|Unify transformer referring|比較電壓與電感前須折算至同一側，匝比定義不可反覆變更。|Voltages and inductances must be referred to one side using a fixed turns-ratio definition.|定義 n=Np/Ns，以 nV2 折算二次電壓，逐項檢查單位。|Define n=Np/Ns, refer secondary voltage as nV2 and check units consistently.
推導電感電壓|Derive inductor voltage|電感電壓是兩橋方波之差，不是任一側 DC 電壓本身。|Inductor voltage is the difference between bridge square waves, not either DC voltage alone.|分區畫 vL=v1−v2′，用 di/dt=vL/L 連接電流斜率。|Plot vL=v1−v2′ by interval and obtain current slopes from di/dt=vL/L.
計算相移功率|Calculate phase-shift power|小相移功率近線性，但完整單相移式含二次項。|Power is nearly linear at small phase shift, but the full SPS expression includes a quadratic term.|重算本課 π/6 的 5.56 kW，再比較 π/12 和 π/3，勿假設皆正比。|Recompute 5.56 kW at π/6, then compare π/12 and π/3 without assuming linearity throughout.
驗證功率方向|Verify power direction|相移符號須與電流和能量正方向一致，負值代表回送。|Phase-shift sign must match current/energy conventions; negative power means reverse transfer.|把 φ 改為 −π/6，核對 P1+P2 在理想模型近零。|Set φ=−π/6 and verify near-zero P1+P2 in an ideal model.
分析電壓失配循環|Analyze mismatch circulation|兩側折算電壓不相等時，零淨功率仍可能有循環電流。|Unequal referred voltages can create circulating current even at zero net power.|φ=0 下比較 V1=V2′ 和相差 20% 的電流 RMS。|At φ=0 compare current RMS for matched voltages and a 20% mismatch.
區分功率電流與 RMS|Separate power current and RMS|相同傳遞功率可有不同峰值與 RMS，影響導通與磁件損耗。|Equal transferred power can have different peaks/RMS and thus conduction/magnetic loss.|比較兩種調變的同功率電流波形，積分 I² 而不只平均值。|Compare equal-power waveforms under two modulations and integrate I² rather than only the mean.
建立 ZVS 電流條件|Build ZVS current conditions|各切換瞬間的電流方向和幅度決定是否能充放節點電容。|Current sign/magnitude at each transition determines node-capacitance commutation.|逐個橋臂標切換電流符號，不以總功率方向推定全部 ZVS。|Mark commutation-current signs per leg; do not infer all ZVS from net power direction.
比較雙重與三重相移|Compare extended phase-shift methods|增加調變自由度可減 RMS 或擴軟切換區，但控制複雜度提高。|More modulation freedom can reduce RMS or extend soft switching, with greater control complexity.|在固定電壓比和功率下比較一組 SPS 與多相移離線波形。|At fixed voltage ratio/power compare one SPS and one multiphase-shift offline waveform.
核對 DC 偏磁|Check DC flux bias|橋脈波不對稱或測量偏移可造成變壓器伏秒不平衡。|Bridge asymmetry or sensing bias can create transformer volt-second imbalance.|積分兩半週伏秒，加入一個時間偏差觀察磁通漂移。|Integrate both half-cycle volt-seconds and inject a timing offset to observe flux drift.
處理雙向模式切換|Handle bidirectional transitions|功率過零時電流、軟切換和控制增益皆可能改變。|Crossing zero power can change current, soft switching and control gain.|回放 +功率→0→−功率，记录母線偏差和電流峰值。|Replay positive/zero/negative power and record bus deviation and current peaks.
交付效率與不確定度|Deliver efficiency and uncertainty|兩側功率差很小時，量測相位與偏移會主導效率誤差。|When losses are small, measurement phase and offset can dominate efficiency error.|假設 10 kW 輸入和各 ±0.5% 量測誤差，評估能否分辨 0.2% 效率差。|At 10 kW with ±0.5% measurement errors assess whether a 0.2% efficiency difference is distinguishable.
''')

C(266,'線電流成形、功率因數、諧波與雙迴路控制','line-current shaping, power factor, harmonics and dual-loop control',
'功率與諧波|升壓與調變|迴路與過零|熱與驗證','Power and harmonics|Boost and modulation|Loops and zero crossing|Thermal and validation',
'pfc gan current','a249 a262','power',
'教學例：輸出 1 kW、效率 95%、輸入 230 Vrms、真功率因數 0.99，Irms=Pout/(ηVrmsPF)=4.62 A。若在相同效率下 PF=0.70，Irms≈6.54 A，線路 I²R 約增至 2 倍。',
'Teaching example: 1 kW output at 95% efficiency, 230 Vrms and true PF 0.99 requires Irms=Pout/(ηVrmsPF)=4.62 A. At PF 0.70 with the same efficiency, Irms≈6.54 A and line I²R is about twice as high.',
'市電與併網測試需合格設備及專業作業；本課只用離線波形，不提供市電接線或安規認證保證。','Mains/interconnection testing needs qualified equipment and professionals; this course uses offline waveforms without wiring instructions or certification claims.',r'''
定義真功率因數|Define true power factor|PF=P/(VrmsIrms)，不同於只看基波相角的位移因數。|PF=P/(VrmsIrms), distinct from fundamental displacement factor alone.|對尖峰電流波形算 RMS 和平均功率，檢查相位同相仍可能低 PF。|Calculate RMS/current and average power for peaked current; in-phase waveforms can still have low PF.
計算諧波失真|Calculate harmonic distortion|電流 THD=√ΣIn²/I1，需明示諧波範圍與基波定義。|Current THD=√ΣIn²/I1 requires specified harmonics and fundamental definition.|I1=10 A、I3=3 A、I5=1 A 時計算 THD≈31.6%。|For I1=10 A, I3=3 A and I5=1 A calculate THD≈31.6%.
分離效率與 PF|Separate efficiency and PF|高 PF 不代表低轉換損耗，高效率也不保證低諧波。|High PF does not imply low conversion loss; high efficiency does not ensure low harmonics.|把效率、PF 和 THD 三項各自放到本課電流算例旁。|List efficiency, PF and THD separately beside the input-current example.
建立 boost 瞬時占空|Build instantaneous boost duty|PFC boost 的占空比隨整流線電壓改變，不能用單一 DC 比例描述全週。|Boost-PFC duty changes with rectified line voltage, not one DC ratio for the whole cycle.|以 D≈1−vline/Vbus 畫一半線週的示意占空比，標記過零極限。|Plot illustrative D≈1−vline/Vbus over a half line-cycle and mark zero-crossing limits.
比較 CCM 與 CRM|Compare CCM and CRM|連續與臨界導通有不同峰值電流、頻率行為和控制要求。|Continuous and critical conduction differ in peak current, frequency behavior and control.|對相同平均輸入電流畫兩種電感波形並比較 RMS。|Draw both inductor waveforms at equal average input current and compare RMS.
分析圖騰柱換流|Analyze totem-pole commutation|高頻與低頻橋臂分工可減整流損耗，但過零換向需要仔細控制。|High/low-frequency leg roles reduce rectification loss but make zero-crossing commutation important.|分正負半週標出電流路徑，查找模式切換的符號不連續。|Mark current paths in both half-cycles and locate sign discontinuities at transitions.
建立電流參考|Build current references|理想電流參考隨輸入電壓成比例，其幅值由慢速電壓環調節。|Ideal current reference follows input voltage, with amplitude set by a slower voltage loop.|將正弦電壓乘固定導納得到參考，注入電壓畸變觀察影響。|Multiply sinusoidal voltage by conductance for the reference and inject distortion to observe its effect.
限制電壓環頻寬|Limit voltage-loop bandwidth|單相功率有二倍線頻脈動，外環太快可能把它調進輸入電流。|Single-phase power has twice-line-frequency ripple; an overly fast outer loop can imprint it on current.|比較電壓環兩種頻寬下的 100/120 Hz 紋波和電流 THD。|Compare 100/120 Hz ripple and current THD at two voltage-loop bandwidths.
管理過零畸變|Manage zero-crossing distortion|感測偏移、最小脈寬與換向死區會影響過零附近電流。|Sensor offset, minimum pulse width and commutation dead time distort near-zero current.|放大過零窗口而非只看整週波形，分類延遲與尖峰。|Zoom into zero-crossing windows instead of only full cycles and classify delay/spikes.
估算匯流排儲能|Estimate bus energy|輸出負載與整流瞬時輸入不一致，電容吸收二倍線頻能量差。|Instantaneous input/output mismatch is buffered by the bus capacitor at twice line frequency.|用 ΔE=CΔ(V²)/2 對照一個紋波週期積分功率差。|Compare ΔE=CΔ(V²)/2 with integrated power mismatch over one ripple cycle.
評估輕載電容電流|Assess light-load capacitive current|EMI 電容電流在輕載時可主導輸入無功，使 PF 下降。|EMI-capacitor current can dominate light-load reactive input and lower PF.|用 I=ωCV 比較固定電容電流與負載從 1 kW 降到 50 W 的有功電流。|Use I=ωCV to compare fixed capacitive current with real current as load falls from 1 kW to 50 W.
交付線路條件矩陣|Deliver line-condition matrices|性能應涵蓋低高線、頻率、負載和電壓畸變，不能只報額定點。|Performance must cover line voltage/frequency, load and distortion, not one rated point.|建立四角條件的 PF、THD、效率與峰流表，標示量測頻寬。|Tabulate PF, THD, efficiency and peak current at corner conditions with measurement bandwidth.
''')

C(267,'隔離門極時序、CMTI、Miller 抑制與故障回報','isolated-gate timing, CMTI, Miller suppression and fault reporting',
'隔離與供電|電荷與迴路|時序與保護|量測與驗證','Isolation and bias|Charge and loops|Timing and protection|Measurement and validation',
'gate sicdriver isolatedgate','a261 a268','power',
'教學例：總閘極電荷 Qg=100 nC、目標電荷轉移時間 100 ns，簡化平均驅動電流 Qg/t=1 A。實際峰流由門極電阻、驅動器輸出阻抗與 Miller 平台決定；用 Qg·ΔV·fs 估平均閘極驅動功率。',
'Teaching example: total gate charge Qg=100 nC transferred in 100 ns implies a simplified mean drive current Qg/t=1 A. Actual peak current depends on gate resistance, driver impedance and the Miller plateau; Qg·ΔV·fs estimates average gate-drive power.',
'隔離額定、爬電距離和保護時間須按器件與應用規範審核；本課無高壓實機量測連接方法。','Isolation ratings, creepage and protection timing require device/application review; no high-voltage physical probing instructions are included.',r'''
區分訊號與功率隔離|Separate signal and bias isolation|訊號跨隔離傳遞不等於門極供電已隔離，兩者需各自確認。|Isolated signal transfer does not mean isolated gate power; both need verification.|畫出數位輸入、隔離柵、輸出供電和功率器件四個域。|Draw four domains: input, isolation barrier, output bias and power device.
解讀工作與耐壓額定|Interpret working/withstand ratings|瞬時耐壓、連續工作電壓與浪湧額定不是同一數值。|Withstand, continuous working and surge ratings are different quantities.|從公開資料表把三者分欄，列出測試時間與波形條件。|Separate the three from a public datasheet and list test durations/waveforms.
建立隔離寄生電容|Model isolation capacitance|隔離柵仍有寄生電容，高 dv/dt 可產生共模位移電流。|An isolation barrier still has capacitance; high dv/dt drives common-mode displacement current.|C=2 pF、dv/dt=50 kV/μs 時估 i=0.1 A 瞬時位移電流。|For 2 pF and 50 kV/μs estimate 0.1 A instantaneous displacement current.
核算閘極電荷|Audit gate charge|Qg 描述充電量，不能僅由 Ciss 常數替代完整 Miller 過程。|Qg describes charge; constant Ciss alone does not capture the full Miller process.|重算本課 1 A 平均值，對照資料表不同 Vds/Id 條件的 Qg。|Recompute 1 A mean current and compare Qg at different datasheet Vds/Id conditions.
分離開通與關斷阻抗|Separate turn-on/off impedance|開通和關斷需要不同速度權衡，驅動器源/汲電能力也不必相同。|Turn-on/off have different speed tradeoffs, and source/sink strengths may differ.|在概念模型使用不同 Ron/Roff，比較電壓過衝與誤觸發。|Use different Ron/Roff in a conceptual model and compare overshoot/false turn-on.
分析 Miller 夾位|Analyze Miller clamping|夾位在關斷階段提供低阻抗路徑，觸發門檻和時序影響效果。|A Miller clamp offers a low-impedance off-state path whose timing/threshold affect effectiveness.|比較有無夾位的合成 Vgs，檢查最壞 dv/dt 時峰值。|Compare synthetic Vgs with/without clamping and inspect peaks at worst dv/dt.
核算傳播延遲匹配|Audit delay matching|上下橋臂延遲失配會侵蝕有效死區，即使各自平均延遲相近。|High/low-side delay mismatch erodes effective dead time even if mean delays look similar.|用最大最小延遲角落值計算最小剩餘死區，而非用典型值相減。|Calculate minimum remaining dead time from worst delay corners rather than typical-value subtraction.
解讀 CMTI|Interpret CMTI|CMTI 描述指定共模瞬變下的資料完整性，不等於隔離耐壓。|CMTI describes data integrity under defined common-mode transients, not dielectric withstand.|把 kV/μs 與 kVrms 量綱分開，標出測試條件。|Separate kV/μs and kVrms dimensions and record test conditions.
設計欠壓狀態|Design undervoltage states|門極偏壓不足可能增加導通損耗，UVLO 應使輸出進入定義狀態。|Insufficient bias can raise conduction loss; UVLO must put output into a defined state.|在離線模型降低偏壓，追蹤輸出狀態及恢復遲滯。|Lower bias in an offline model and trace output state/recovery hysteresis.
協調 DESAT 與過流|Coordinate DESAT and overcurrent|不同檢測法有空白時間、噪聲和器件適配限制。|Detection methods differ in blanking, noise and device suitability.|在合成故障時序分出空白、檢測、傳播及软關斷四段。|Split synthetic fault timing into blanking, detection, propagation and soft-turn-off stages.
驗證故障回報與復歸|Validate fault reporting/reset|故障回報、鎖存與復歸須避免故障仍在時反覆重啟。|Fault reporting, latching and reset must avoid repetitive restart into a persistent fault.|回放持續故障及瞬時故障，檢查狀態機是否區分。|Replay persistent and transient faults and check state-machine distinction.
交付驅動完整性矩陣|Deliver driver-integrity matrices|驅動驗證需同時覆蓋偏壓、溫度、共模邊沿及延遲角落。|Driver validation must jointly cover bias, temperature, common-mode edges and delay corners.|建立角落案例表，將只有典型數據支持的項目標記為未完成。|Build corner-case tables and mark items supported only by typical data as incomplete.
''')

C(268,'分流、磁性感測、量測誤差與快速保護','shunts, magnetic sensing, measurement errors and fast protection',
'感測與範圍|類比與取樣|保護與時序|校準與驗證','Sensing and ranges|Analog and sampling|Protection and timing|Calibration and validation',
'current currentproduct gate','a242 a267','power',
'教學例：Rshunt=1 mΩ、I=50 A，壓降 50 mV、耗散 I²R=2.5 W。若增益 20 V/V，輸出訊號增量 1 V；輸入偏移 25 μV 相當於 25 mA 電流誤差，不包含增益、溫漂和 ADC 誤差。',
'Teaching example: a 1 mΩ shunt at 50 A drops 50 mV and dissipates I²R=2.5 W. Gain 20 V/V yields a 1 V signal increment. A 25 μV input offset equals 25 mA current error, excluding gain, drift and ADC errors.',
'感測器頻寬或量測精度不代表保護已足夠；隔離、過載和故障切離需獨立證據，不提供實機故障注入指令。','Sensor bandwidth/accuracy does not establish sufficient protection; isolation, overload and interruption need independent evidence, without physical fault-injection instructions.',r'''
比較分流與磁性感測|Compare shunt and magnetic sensing|分流直接量電阻壓降，Hall/磁通技術透過磁場，各有隔離與偏移權衡。|Shunts measure resistive drop; Hall/flux technologies sense fields, with isolation/offset tradeoffs.|用同一電流範圍比較插入損耗、DC 能力和隔離需求。|At equal range compare insertion loss, DC capability and isolation requirements.
選擇高側與低側位置|Choose high/low-side placement|低側感測可改變地參考，高側量測需承受共模範圍。|Low-side sensing shifts ground reference; high-side sensing needs common-mode capability.|在兩種原創接線概念圖追蹤負載短接到地時是否仍可見電流。|On two original conceptual diagrams trace whether a load-to-ground fault remains observable.
核算量程與發熱|Audit range and heating|降低分流電阻可降損，但讓偏移和雜訊佔更大比例。|Lower shunt resistance reduces loss but raises relative offset/noise impact.|重算本課 2.5 W；R 減半後同時比較壓降與等效電流偏移。|Recompute 2.5 W; halve R and compare both voltage drop and equivalent current offset.
建立增益與 ADC 範圍|Build gain/ADC ranges|增益需容納正負電流、偏置與故障裕度，不能剛好頂到 ADC 滿刻度。|Gain must allow bidirectional current, bias and fault margin rather than exactly fill the ADC range.|以中點偏置把 ±50 A 映到 ADC 範圍，檢查兩端餘裕。|Map ±50 A around midscale and check headroom at both ADC limits.
分解誤差預算|Decompose error budgets|偏移是近固定電壓，增益誤差隨訊號增加，溫漂則依溫度差。|Offset is near-fixed voltage, gain error scales with signal and drift depends on temperature change.|分別在 1 A 和 50 A 計算同一偏移的相對誤差。|Calculate the same offset’s relative error at 1 A and 50 A.
辨識 Kelvin 取樣|Identify Kelvin sensing|大電流銅箔壓降若混入取樣端會形成額外電阻誤差。|Power-trace voltage drop included in sense leads creates extra resistance error.|在等效圖加入 0.1 mΩ 走線，與 1 mΩ 分流比較 10% 附加誤差。|Add 0.1 mΩ trace resistance to a 1 mΩ shunt model and identify 10% extra error.
評估共模暫態|Assess common-mode transients|高 DC CMRR 不保證 PWM 邊沿後能即時恢復。|High DC CMRR does not guarantee immediate recovery after PWM edges.|用相同差動信號加入共模階躍，量恢復時間與假尖峰。|Add common-mode steps at fixed differential signal and measure settling/false spikes.
安排抗混疊濾波|Arrange anti-alias filtering|ADC 前濾波需在抗混疊與保護延遲間權衡。|Pre-ADC filtering trades alias rejection against protection delay.|比較 RC 截止頻率減半後的噪聲與階躍到閾值時間。|Halve RC cutoff and compare noise with time to a threshold after a step.
同步 PWM 取樣|Synchronize PWM sampling|取樣時刻若靠近切換邊沿，尖峰和放大器恢復會污染讀值。|Sampling near switching edges captures spikes and amplifier recovery artifacts.|在離線 PWM 周期掃描取樣相位，標出可用窗口。|Sweep sample phase over an offline PWM cycle and mark usable windows.
分離控制與保護路徑|Separate control and protection paths|慢速高精度 ADC 路徑未必满足快速故障保護需求。|A slow precision ADC path may not meet fast fault-protection needs.|分別畫控制估測和硬體比較器概念路徑，核算各自延遲。|Draw separate control-estimation and hardware-comparator concepts and total their delays.
設計遲滯與去毛刺|Design hysteresis and deglitching|去毛刺可減誤報，也可能延遲真故障；遲滯和時間濾波不同。|Deglitching reduces false trips but delays real faults; hysteresis differs from time filtering.|對短雜訊脈波和持續過流兩個合成輸入比較輸出。|Compare outputs for a short noise pulse and sustained overcurrent in synthetic inputs.
交付校準與故障證據|Deliver calibration/fault evidence|零點校準不能自動修正增益、溫漂與飽和恢復。|Zero calibration does not automatically correct gain, drift or saturation recovery.|建立零點、兩點增益、溫度和過載恢復的分離驗證表。|Build separate checks for zero, two-point gain, temperature and overload recovery.
''')
